da dragonhawk!" }, { 12096, 3.7, true, "Fire kill you just as quick!" }, { 12097, 4.1, true, "You too slow! Me too strong!" }, { 12098, 2.8, true, "Da Amani di chuka!" }, { 12099, 2.8, true, "Lot more going to fall like you." }, { 12100, 8.6, true, "Mebbe me fall... but da Amani empire... never going to die." } }, title = "Warlord of Zul'Aman", visageOf = "zuljin", shape = "Hawk" },
    { id = "cobrahn_serpent", entry = 5791, name = "Lord Cobrahn", label = "Lord Cobrahn", level = 20, display = 4435, height = 5.2, span = 8.2, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_SnakeTrap", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 16375, 16866, 6607, 7399, 54603 }, passives = { 3616 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Cobra Venom", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Poison_02", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Fanglord's Coils", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_WindSerpent", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Cobra's Reflexes", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_CobraStrikes", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Strike of the Fang", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Rake", text = "Your chance to land a critical strike in melee is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Coiled Tail", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_CriticalStrike", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Lash by 5 sec.\n\nA cobra's tail is never still; it is always drawing back for the next blow." }, { name = "Sway of the Cobra", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_PoisonCleansingTotem", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to gain Serpent's Agility. Once every 30 sec.\n\nStrike at the Fanglord's serpent shape and it is already somewhere else, hood spread, waiting." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 5785, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Wailing Caverns", expansion = 0, order = 54, as = 3669, box = { -1.96, -0.02, 2.56 }, voices = { { 5785, 1.8, true, "You will never wake the dreamer!" } }, title = "Fanglord", visageOf = "cobrahn", shape = "Serpent" },
    { id = "illidan_demon", entry = 23195, name = "Illidan Stormrage", label = "Illidan Stormrage", level = 73, display = 21322, height = 14.1, span = 19.8, school = "shadow", pool = "tbc", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Metamorphosis", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 41078, 30941, 60744, 40585, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Skull of Gul'dan", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Metamorphosis", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Fel Immolation", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelImmolation", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Demonic Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_MonsterScales_07", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Hatred of Ten Thousand Years", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_BloodRage", text = "Your attack power is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Is This All the Fury", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelFlameRing", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to erupt in Flame Burst. Once every 20 sec.\n\nIs this it, mortals? Strike the demon and it answers in fel fire." }, { name = "You Know Nothing of Power", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your Shadow Blast deals 15% more damage.\n\nYou know nothing of power! The Skull of Gul'dan feeds every blast Illidan throws." } }, tips = { [261] = "Come, my minions! Call a Shadow Demon to stalk your foe for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 11475, soundDeath = 11478, flies = true, wave = 4, instance = "Black Temple", expansion = 1, order = 386, as = 22917, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -4.26, 1.40, 7.02 }, voices = { { 11465, 8.7, true, "Come, my minions. Deal with this traitor as he deserves!" }, { 11473, 6.6, true, "Who shall be next to taste my blades?" }, { 11472, 3.8, true, "This is too easy!" }, { 11479, 6.4, true, "I will not be touched by rabble such as you!" }, { 11480, 6.1, true, "Behold the Flames of Azzinoth!" }, { 11481, 5.8, true, "Stare into the eyes of the Betrayer!" }, { 11475, 8.2, true, "Behold the power... of the demon within!" }, { 11474, 9.5, true, "You've wasted too much time, mortals. Now you shall fall." }, { 11467, 4.9, true, "I can feel your hatred." }, { 11468, 4.8, true, "Give in to your fear!" }, { 11469, 5.2, true, "You know nothing of power!" }, { 11471, 4.5, true, "Such... arrogance!" } }, title = "The Betrayer", visageOf = "illidan", shape = "Demon" },
    { id = "leotheras_demon", entry = 21845, name = "Leotheras the Blind", label = "Leotheras the Blind", level = 73, display = 20125, height = 10.8, span = 11.0, school = "fire", pool = "tbc", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelFire", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 39054, 35959, 39262, 39135, 36127 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Chaos Unbound", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelFire", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Who's the Master Now", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_BloodRage", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Demon Skin", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Your Shadow resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Blind Fury", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DemonicTactics", text = "Your Agility is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Insidious Whispers", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ManaBurn", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to Mana Burn the target. Once every 30 sec.\n\nThe demon whispers to every mind it touches and leaves each one a little emptier." }, { name = "I Am in Control Now", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FelImmolation", text = "Your Fel Immolation covers a 20% larger area.\n\nBe gone, trifling elf. I am in control now! The demon burns wider than Leotheras ever dared." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 11304, soundDeath = 11317, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Coilfang: Serpentshrine Cavern", expansion = 1, order = 375, box = { -1.74, -0.04, 4.87 }, title = "The Demon Within", visageOf = "leotheras", shape = "Demon" },
    { id = "solarian_void", entry = 22290, name = "High Astromancer Solarian", label = "High Astromancer Solarian", level = 73, display = 18988, height = 28.7, span = 28.7, school = "shadow", pool = "tbc", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SummonVoidWalker", profile = "caster", kit = { 39329, 24212, 37412, 34322 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "One with the Void", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SummonVoidWalker", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Abyssal Gaze", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadeTrueSight", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Body of the Void", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Hunger of the Void", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SiphonMana", text = "The mana cost of your Shadow spells is reduced by 8%." }, { name = "The Void Answers", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Shadow Vault the attacker. Once every 20 sec.\n\nWhat Solarian became does not tolerate being touched." }, { name = "Fury of the Cosmos", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Twilight", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Void Corruption by 4 sec.\n\nSolarian hungers now, and the void she opened is never quite closed." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 11136, soundDeath = 11135, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Tempest Keep", expansion = 1, order = 398, as = 18805, box = { -0.60, 0.09, 14.99 }, voices = { { 11134, 3.9, true, "Tal anu'men no sin'dorei!" }, { 11139, 4.1, true, "You are hopelessly outmatched!" }, { 11140, 4.3, true, "I will crush your delusions of grandeur!" }, { 11136, 3.5, true, "Your soul belongs to the abyss!" }, { 11137, 3.2, true, "By the blood of the Highborne!" }, { 11138, 2.6, true, "For the Sunwell!" }, { 11135, 4.0, true, "The warmth of the sun... awaits." } }, title = "One with the Void", visageOf = "solarian", shape = "Void" },
    { id = "entropius", entry = 25840, name = "Entropius", label = "M'uru", level = 73, display = 23428, height = 19.1, span = 19.1, school = "shadow", pool = "tbc", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Twilight", profile = "caster", kit = { 45996, 46285, 46087, 46230 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Void Heart", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Twilight", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Singularity", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowFury", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Mass of Darkness", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AuraOfDarkness", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Entropy", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SiphonMana", text = "The mana cost of your Shadow spells is reduced by 8%." }, { name = "The Void Devours", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Shadesofdarkness", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to send out a Shadow Pulse. Once every 20 sec.\n\nThe void unleashed pulls on everything it touches." }, { name = "Light Consumed", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_AuraMastery", text = "Your Darkness deals 15% more damage.\n\nWhere Entropius has been, the Light does not come back for a long time." } }, tips = { [45996] = "Open a pool of darkness under you for 20 sec: enemies in it take 3000 Shadow damage every 1 sec and cannot be healed.", [46087] = "Send out a pulse of shadow, dealing 3750 Shadow damage to enemies close by.", [46230] = "The void unleashed pulls on everything: drag enemies within 10 yards toward you." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 12215, soundDeath = 12219, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "The Sunwell", expansion = 1, order = 423, box = { 0.33, 0.08, 12.31 }, title = "The Void Unleashed", visageOf = "muru", shape = "Entropius" },
    { id = "ingvar_undead", entry = 23980, name = "Ingvar the Plunderer", label = "Ingvar the Plunderer", level = 72, display = 26351, height = 5.5, span = 5.5, school = "shadow", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AnimateDead", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 42723, 42729, 42730, 42751, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Chosen of the Death God", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathScream", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Undying Warrior", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AnimateDead", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "A Second Chance", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Warrior Born", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your Strength is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Woe and Ruin", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DecisiveStrike", text = "Your melee attacks have an 8% chance to add a Woe Strike. Once every 30 sec.\n\nWhat the Lich King raised does not want its enemies healed." }, { name = "The Death God Hungers", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyFrenzy", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Dark Smash by 10 sec.\n\nRisen Ingvar swings with the strength of the thing that raised him." } }, tips = { [261] = "Call Annhylde the Caller, the val'kyr who raised you, to fight at your side for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 13209, soundDeath = 13211, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Utgarde Keep", expansion = 2, order = 444, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.04, -0.26, 2.77 }, voices = { { 13209, 5.0, true, "I return! A second chance to carve your skull!" }, { 13214, 2.4, true, "I am a warrior born!" }, { 13211, 5.0, true, "No! I can do... better! I can..." } }, title = "Servant of the Death God", visageOf = "ingvar", shape = "Undead" },
    { id = "hydross_corrupt", entry = 21932, name = "Hydross the Unstable", label = "Hydross the Unstable", level = 73, display = 20609, height = 13.4, span = 16.8, school = "nature", pool = "tbc", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_CorrosiveBreath", profile = "caster", kit = { 38246, 38253, 40100, 38219, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Poisoned Tide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_CorrosiveBreath", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Toxic Body", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_NullifyPoison", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 60." }, { name = "Flowing Sludge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_Wisp", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Corrupted Mana", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Poison_03", text = "The mana cost of your Nature spells is reduced by 8%." }, { name = "You Are the Disease", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Acid_01", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to spit a Poison Bolt at the attacker. Once every 30 sec.\n\nYou... are the disease... not I... Whatever touches the corrupted Duke comes away fouled." }, { name = "Poisoned Currents", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shaman_TidalWaves", text = "Your Crashing Wave deals 15% more damage.\n\nSerpentshrine's poisoned water hits harder once Hydross is part of it." } }, tips = { [261] = "They have forced me to this... Split off two Tainted Spawn of Hydross to fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 11297, soundDeath = 11300, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Coilfang: Serpentshrine Cavern", expansion = 1, order = 369, as = 21216, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.02, 0.01, 8.52 }, voices = { { 11289, 3.5, true, "I cannot allow you to interfere!" }, { 11290, 4.6, true, "Better, much better." }, { 11291, 3.0, true, "They have forced me to this...." }, { 11292, 2.6, true, "I had no choice." }, { 11293, 4.4, true, "I am... released." } }, title = "Duke of Currents", visageOf = "hydross", shape = "Corrupt" },
    { id = "putricide_mutated", entry = 38216, name = "Mutated Professor Putricide", label = "Professor Putricide", level = 83, display = 30993, height = 9.2, span = 14.4, school = "nature", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\achievement_boss_profputricide", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 70539, 15496, 70853, 26072 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "His Own Test Subject", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_UnyeildingStamina", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Mutated Strength", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your attack power is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Mutated Transformation", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_PlagueCloud", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Mad Scientist", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Acid_01", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Guzzle Potions", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Potion_27", text = "Your melee attacks have an 8% chance to Regurgitate Ooze. Once every 20 sec.\n\nOH! Excuse me!" }, { name = "Mutated Slash", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_MonsterClaw_03", text = "Your Mutated Slash deals 15% more damage.\n\nThe professor's new arms hit harder than his old." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 17121, soundDeath = 17117, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Icecrown Citadel", expansion = 2, order = 565, box = { 1.51, -0.19, 4.61 }, title = "His Own Test Subject", visageOf = "putricide", shape = "Mutated" },
    { id = "attumen_unmounted", entry = 15550, name = "Attumen the Huntsman", label = "Attumen the Huntsman", level = 73, display = 16416, height = 3.5, span = 3.5, school = "shadow", pool = "tbc", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_SniperShot", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 29832, 6016, 18812, 29833, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Shadow-Edged Blade", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "A Warrior of My Skill", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_WeaponMastery", text = "Your chance to critically hit with melee attacks is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Intangible", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Twilight", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Trophy Hunter", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your attack power is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Such Easy Sport", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Riposte", text = "Your melee attacks have a 10% chance to Shadow Cleave the target and its nearest allies. Once every 20 sec.\n\nWeapons are merely a convenience for a warrior of my skill! The Huntsman finds the gap in any armour." }, { name = "Always the Hunter", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_CheapShot", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Knockdown by 15 sec.\n\nUnhorsed, Attumen fights closer; the Huntsman's boot finds a knee sooner." } }, tips = { [261] = "Perhaps you would rather test yourselves against a more formidable opponent! Call two Spectral Chargers from the stables of Karazhan to fight for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 9299, soundDeath = 9165, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Karazhan", expansion = 1, order = 348, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.18, -0.00, 1.72 }, voices = { { 9169, 2.5, true, "It was... inevitable." }, { 9300, 3.0, true, "Another trophy to add to my collection!" }, { 9170, 3.2, true, "Such easy sport." }, { 9304, 5.7, true, "Amateurs! Do not think you can best me! I kill for a living." }, { 9166, 4.5, true, "Weapons are merely a convenience for a warrior of my skill!" }, { 9173, 2.7, true, "Well done, Midnight!" }, { 9167, 3.0, true, "Cowards! Wretches!" }, { 9298, 3.6, true, "Who dares attack the steed of the Huntsman?" }, { 9299, 5.5, true, "Perhaps you would rather test yourselves against a more formidable opponent?!" }, { 9168, 4.0, true, "Come Midnight, let's disperse this petty rabble!" } }, title = "Huntsman of Karazhan", visageOf = "attumen", shape = "Unhorsed" },
    { id = "grandmother", entry = 17603, name = "Grandmother", label = "The Big Bad Wolf", level = 70, display = 17121, height = 2.4, span = 2.4, school = "physical", pool = "tbc", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Disguise", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 60540, 42320, 27557, 34189 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "What Big Teeth You Have", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Wolf", text = "Your chance to critically hit with melee attacks is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Fur Under the Shawl", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Pelt_Wolf_01", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Sweet Old Lady", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Disguise", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 6%." }, { name = "Picnic Appetite", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize", text = "Your attack power is increased by 10%." }, { name = "The Better to See You With", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Rake", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Bite the attacker. Once every 15 sec.\n\nCome closer, my child. Whoever lays a hand on Grandmother finds out what is under the nightcap." }, { name = "Still Warm", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Food_15", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Picnic Basket Smell by 10 sec.\n\nThere is always another basket on the way to Grandmother's house." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 2940, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Karazhan", expansion = 1, order = 345, charModel = true, box = { -0.13, 0.01, 1.20 }, title = "The Wolf in Disguise", visageOf = "bigbadwolf", shape = "Grandmother" },
    { id = "madrigosa", entry = 24895, name = "Madrigosa", label = "Felmyst", level = 73, display = 22965, height = 25.3, span = 53.6, school = "frost", pool = "tbc", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Head_Dragon_Blue", profile = "caster", kit = { 45065, 21098, 46555, 44843 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Breath of Winter", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_ChillingBlast", text = "Your Frost damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Madrigosa's Scales", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_MonsterScales_07", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Loyal to Malygos", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Head_Dragon_Blue", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Wintry Resolve", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostArmor02", text = "Your Frost resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Guardian of the Sunwell", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostNova", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Chill the enemies around you. Once every 20 sec.\n\nMadrigosa held the Sunwell's gate alone; whatever reaches her is met with ice." }, { name = "Arcane Blood", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostBolt02", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Frost Breath by 4 sec.\n\nThe blue dragonflight breathes winter as easily as others breathe air." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 4991, soundTransform = 12474, soundDeath = 12476, flies = true, wave = 4, instance = "The Sunwell", expansion = 1, order = 417, box = { -8.48, 0.00, 11.43 }, voices = { { 12472, 6.4, true, "Hold, friends! There is information to be had before this devil meets his fate!" }, { 12473, 5.3, true, "Where is Anveena, demon? What has become of Kalec?" }, { 12474, 2.8, true, "You will tell me where they are!" }, { 12475, 3.9, true, "Speak! I grow weary of asking!" }, { 12476, 5.1, true, "Malygos, my lord... I did my... best." } }, title = "Of the Blue Dragonflight", visageOf = "felmyst", shape = "Living" },
    { id = "cthun_awakened", entry = 15809, name = "C'Thun", label = "C'Thun", level = 63, display = 15786, height = 31.9, span = 49.7, school = "nature", pool = "classic_raid", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_CThun", profile = "tank", kit = { 26476, 26478, 26141, 3391, 37548, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Carapace of C'Thun", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Qiraj_CarapaceOldGod", text = "Your carapace turns aside the worst of it: damage you take is reduced by 10%." }, { name = "Bottomless Stomach", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Worm", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 12%." }, { name = "The God Is Watching", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Charm", text = "Every mind in the room turns toward you: the threat you cause is increased by 30%." }, { name = "The Pit Answers", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Earthquake", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to set off a Ground Rupture. Once every 15 sec.\n\nStrike the god and the floor of the pit strikes back." }, { name = "Slow Digestion", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Acid_01", text = "Your Digestive Acid lasts 3 sec. longer.\n\nNothing swallowed by C'Thun leaves quickly, and nothing leaves whole." } }, tips = { [261] = "Your stomach wall stirs: two Flesh Tentacles rise at your side and lash your enemies for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 8581, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Ahn'Qiraj Temple", expansion = 0, order = 262, as = 15727, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.56, 0.95, 10.07 }, view = { -8.5304, 0.6362, 6.8154 }, title = "Old God of Madness and Chaos", visageOf = "cthun", shape = "Awakened" },
    { id = "cthun_eye", entry = 15589, name = "Eye of C'Thun", label = "C'Thun", level = 63, display = 15556, height = 69.7, span = 69.7, school = "nature", pool = "classic_raid", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Eye_01", profile = "caster", kit = { 26134, 26029, 26108, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Eye of the Old God", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Eye_01", text = "Your gaze burns: your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Carapace of C'Thun", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Qiraj_CarapaceOldGod", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 8%." }, { name = "Unblinking", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Eye_02", text = "Your chance to critically strike with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Death Is Close", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Slow", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to loose an Eye Beam at the target. Once every 8 sec.\n\nDeath is close. The eye does not need to blink to find the next one." }, { name = "The Watching Pit", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowFury", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Dark Glare by 8 sec.\n\nThe great eye turns slowly, but it never stops turning." } }, tips = { [261] = "Eyes open in the floor of the pit: two Eye Tentacles rise at your side and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 8697, soundDeath = 8700, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Ahn'Qiraj Temple", expansion = 0, order = 263, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.01, 0.00, 11.65 }, view = { -62.7507, 0.4461, 4.3024 }, title = "Old God of Madness and Chaos", visageOf = "cthun", shape = "Eye" },
    { id = "devourer_sorrow", entry = 36503, name = "Devourer of Souls", label = "Devourer of Souls", level = 82, display = 30149, height = 12.6, span = 12.6, school = "shadow", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_DevourerOfSouls", profile = "caster", kit = { 68895, 69148, 16608, 50760 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Operator of the Soul Grinders", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SoulGem", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Face of Sorrow", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyFrenzy", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Engine of Souls", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Gem_Stone_01", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Fed on Grief", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_LifeDrain02", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Spiteful Face", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathScream", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to loose Spite. Once every 20 sec.\n\nThe face of sorrow takes every wound personally." }, { name = "Endless Grief", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_PsychicScream", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Wail of Souls by 5 sec.\n\nSorrow never lets the wailing stop for long." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 16899, soundDeath = 16898, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "The Forge of Souls", expansion = 2, order = 515, as = 36502, box = { -0.21, 0.00, 6.60 }, title = "Operator of the Soul Grinders", visageOf = "devourer", shape = "Sorrow" },
    { id = "devourer_desire", entry = 36504, name = "Devourer of Souls", label = "Devourer of Souls", level = 82, display = 30150, height = 12.6, span = 12.6, school = "shadow", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_DevourerOfSouls", profile = "caster", kit = { 68982, 69128, 69131, 40368 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Operator of the Soul Grinders", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SoulGem", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Face of Desire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Charm", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Engine of Souls", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Gem_Stone_01", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Fed on Longing", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_LifeDrain02", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Soul Siphon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_LifeDrain", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to add a Soul Siphon. Once every 15 sec.\n\nThe face of desire always wants a little more of whoever it looks at." }, { name = "Irresistible", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordDominate", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Soul Sickness by 5 sec.\n\nDesire sickens the soul again before the last longing fades." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 16895, soundDeath = 16893, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "The Forge of Souls", expansion = 2, order = 514, as = 36502, box = { -0.38, 0.07, 6.60 }, title = "Operator of the Soul Grinders", visageOf = "devourer", shape = "Desire" },
    { id = "yoggsaron_awakened", entry = 33883, name = "Yogg-Saron", label = "Yogg-Saron", level = 83, display = 28945, height = 29.1, span = 39.1, school = "shadow", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Achievement_Boss_YoggSaron_01", profile = "caster", kit = { 64189, 64168, 64468, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "The Beast With a Thousand Maws", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Old God Awakened", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyFrenzy", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Sanity's End", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Charm", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Empowered", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordDominate", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Death Ray", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_MindRot", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to open a Lunatic Gaze. Once every 20 sec.\n\nYour fate is sealed. The end of days is finally upon you and all who inhabit this miserable little seedling." }, { name = "Uulwi Ifis Halahs Gag Erh'ongg", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathScream", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Deafening Roar by 15 sec.\n\nThe Old God awake roars again before the room has heard the first." } }, tips = { [261] = "Call a faceless guardian up from the depths to fight for you for 20 sec; your Empowering Shadows mend it." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 15755, soundDeath = 15761, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Ulduar", expansion = 2, order = 502, as = 33288, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -1.85, 0.03, 2.30 }, voices = { { 15756, 4.0, true, "MADNESS WILL CONSUME YOU!" }, { 15755, 7.1, true, "Look upon the true face of death, and know that your end comes soon!" }, { 15758, 3.2, true, "Eternal suffering awaits!" }, { 15761, 16.2, true, "Your fate is sealed. The end of days is finally upon you and ALL who inhabit this miserable little seedling. Uulwi ifis halahs gag erh'ongg w'ssh." } }, title = "The Beast With a Thousand Maws", visageOf = "yoggsaron", shape = "Awakened" },
    { id = "acidmaw_mobile", entry = 34798, name = "Acidmaw", label = "Acidmaw", level = 83, display = 29816, height = 16.6, span = 22.5, school = "nature", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Acid_01", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 58996, 66818, 66794, 5567 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Acidmaw's Venom", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Acid_01", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Jormungar Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_MonsterScales_07", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Burrower", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Dash", text = "Your movement speed is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Paralytic Venom", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Poison_03", text = "Your attack power is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Hungry Fangs", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Poison_01", text = "Your melee attacks have an 8% chance to add a Paralytic Bite. Once every 15 sec.\n\nAcidmaw's fangs never run dry; every bite leaves venom for the next." }, { name = "Churning Ground", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_MonsterTail_03", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Sweep by 5 sec.\n\nThe larva thrashes whenever it breaks the surface." } }, tips = { [66818] = "Spew acid over the enemies before you for 2.5 sec, burning them with Nature damage." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 12917, soundDeath = 12921, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Trial of the Crusader", expansion = 2, order = 550, as = 35144, box = { -3.43, -0.17, 7.01 }, title = "Beast of Northrend", visageOf = "acidmaw", shape = "Mobile" },
    { id = "buru_cracked", entry = 15507, name = "Buru the Gorger", label = "Buru the Gorger", level = 63, display = 15655, height = 10.8, span = 15.0, school = "nature", pool = "classic_raid", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_AhnQirajTrinket_02", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 96, 20512, 65828, 48193, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Plague of the Hive", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_CorrosiveBreath", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Feeding Frenzy", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Egg-Swollen Bulk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Worm", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Last of the Hive", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_AhnQirajTrinket_05", text = "Your attack power is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Gorger's Hunger", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Rupture", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Dismember the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nBuru eats everything in his path: eggs, silithid, adventurers. He has never once been full." }, { name = "Nothing Left to Guard", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyFrenzy", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Exposed Fury by 10 sec.\n\nWith his carapace cracked open, Buru has nothing left to protect and no reason to slow down." } }, tips = { [20512] = "Breathe the creeping plague of the hive over nearby enemies, dealing 70 Nature damage every 2 sec for 20 sec.", [261] = "Crack open the eggs of the hive: two Hive'Zara Hatchlings swarm out and fight at your side for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj", expansion = 0, order = 300, as = 15370, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.93, 0.23, 5.41 }, title = "Silithid Colossus", visageOf = "buru", shape = "Cracked" },
    { id = "horseman_unhorsed", entry = 23800, name = "Headless Horseman", label = "Headless Horseman", level = 80, display = 22352, height = 3.0, span = 3.0, school = "fire", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bag_28_Halloween", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 43118, 42587, 42514, 42380, 20701 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Hallow's End Fire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fire", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Headless Fury", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your chance to critically hit with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Undying Rider", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Whirling Blade", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Whirlwind", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Where's My Head?", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Bladestorm", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Whirl. Once every 15 sec.\n\nWithout a head the Horseman cannot see who hit him, so he hits everyone." }, { name = "Hurry Back", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Food_59", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Squash Soul by 5 sec.\n\nThe unhorsed Horseman squashes souls in a hurry; his head is waiting." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 11969, soundDeath = 11964, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scarlet Monastery", expansion = 2, order = 503, as = 23682, box = { -0.26, 0.00, 1.51 }, voices = { { 11961, 8.0, true, "It is over, your search is done. Let fate choose now, the righteous one." }, { 12567, 8.3, true, "Here's my body, fit and pure! Now, your blackened souls I'll cure!" }, { 11963, 8.5, true, "Soldiers arise, stand and fight! Bring victory at last to this fallen knight!" }, { 11964, 8.7, true, "This end have I reached before. What new adventure lies in store?" }, { 11962, 8.6, true, "Your body lies beaten, battered and broken! Let my curse be your own, fate has spoken!" } }, title = "Terror of Hallow's End", visageOf = "headless_horseman", shape = "Unhorsed" },
    { id = "dathrohan", entry = 10812, name = "Grand Crusader Dathrohan", label = "Balnazzar", level = 62, display = 10545, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "holy", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_CrusaderStrike", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 17281, 17284, 17286, 15493, 20830 }, passives = { 8990 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Zeal of the Crusade", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_CrusaderStrike", text = "Your Holy damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Might of the Grand Crusader", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_SealOfMight", text = "Your attack power is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Devotion of the Faithful", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_DevotionAura", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "The Stolen Face", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Charm", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "The Mask Slips", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyFrenzy", text = "Your melee attacks have an 8% chance to loose a Mind Blast at the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nIn the heat of battle the Grand Crusader's piety cracks, and something older looks out." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 154, soundTransform = 1263, soundDeath = 2944, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Stratholme", expansion = 0, order = 201, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.00, 1.06 }, title = "Leader of the Scarlet Crusade", visageOf = "balnazzar", shape = "Crusader" },
    { id = "cyanigosa_elf", entry = 31134, name = "Cyanigosa", label = "Cyanigosa", level = 77, display = 27508, height = 2.8, span = 2.8, school = "arcane", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Staff_08", profile = "caster", kit = { 58693, 58457, 58463, 60182, 36097 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Arcane Assault", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_Arcane04", text = "Your Arcane damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Frost of the Nexus", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostBolt02", text = "Your Frost damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Lieutenant's Poise", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_PrismaticCloak", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Spell-Weaver's Chosen", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_MindMastery", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Underestimated", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_Blast", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to cast Mana Detonation. Once every 30 sec.\n\nPerhaps... we have... underestimated... you. Cyanigosa does not let anyone close twice." }, { name = "Dalaran Will Fall", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_Glacier", text = "Your Cone of Cold deals 15% more damage.\n\nThe blue flight's lieutenant brings Northrend's cold to the Violet Hold's doorstep." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 1005, soundTransform = 13946, soundDeath = 13955, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Violet Hold", expansion = 2, order = 475, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.04, 1.41 }, voices = { { 13947, 4.2, true, "We finish this now, champions of Kirin Tor!" }, { 13952, 3.6, true, "I will end the Kirin Tor!" }, { 13953, 2.9, true, "Dalaran WILL fall!" }, { 13954, 4.3, true, "So ends you defiance of the Spell-Weaver." }, { 13955, 4.5, true, "Perhaps... we have... underestimated... you." }, { 13946, 8.3, true, "A valiant defense, but this city must be razed. I will fulfill Malygos's wishes myself!" }, { 13951, 2.3, true, "Am I interrupting?" }, { 13948, 2.2, true, "Shiver and die!" }, { 13949, 7.2, true, "The world has forgotten what true magic is! Let this be a reminder!" }, { 13950, 4.5, true, "Who among you can withstand my power?" } }, title = "Lieutenant of Malygos", visageOf = "cyanigosa", shape = "Blood elf" },
    { id = "black_knight_skeleton", entry = 35547, name = "The Black Knight", label = "The Black Knight", level = 80, display = 29846, height = 3.8, span = 3.8, school = "shadow", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 67781, 67725, 71488, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Agent of the Lich King", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Deathknight_ClassIcon", text = "Your attack power is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Bones of the Knight", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bone_HumanSkull_01", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Unholy Strength", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Deathknight_UnholyPresence", text = "Your Strength is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Deathless", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AnimateDead", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Grasping Dead", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowFiend", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Desecrate the ground. Once every 20 sec.\n\nThe dead under the Coliseum's sand reach up for anyone who strikes the Knight's bones." }, { name = "Army Unending", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Army of the Dead by 20 sec.\n\nEvery champion slain on the Coliseum sand is one more ghoul for the Knight's bones to call." } }, tips = { [261] = "Raise three Ghoul Minions from the Argent Coliseum's sand to fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 16262, soundDeath = 2515, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Trial of the Champion", expansion = 2, order = 510, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.40, -0.11, 1.90 }, title = "Agent of the Lich King", visageOf = "the_black_knight", shape = "Skeleton" },
    { id = "black_knight_ghost", entry = 35557, name = "The Black Knight", label = "The Black Knight", level = 80, display = 21300, height = 5.2, span = 5.2, school = "shadow", pool = "wotlk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Haunting", profile = "caster", kit = { 67808, 67745, 38183, 35914 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Death's Bite", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Spectral Form", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Twilight", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 6%." }, { name = "Frost of the Grave", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_DeathKnight_FrostFever", text = "Your Frost damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Undying Will", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AnimateDead", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Spectral Bite", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathScream", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to add a Death's Bite. Once every 20 sec.\n\nThe ghost of the Black Knight bites whoever its wail has already touched." }, { name = "Last Breath", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_MarkedForDeath", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Marked for Death by 15 sec.\n\nWith nothing left to lose, the Knight's ghost marks again and again." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 16263, soundDeath = 16264, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Trial of the Champion", expansion = 2, order = 509, box = { -0.36, -0.29, 2.08 }, title = "Agent of the Lich King", visageOf = "the_black_knight", shape = "Ghost" },
    { id = "oggleflint", entry = 11517, name = "Oggleflint", label = "Oggleflint", level = 16, display = 11611, height = 1.9, span = 1.9, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Mace_1H_TroggKing_C_01", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 40505, 6253, 36645, 22693, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Chieftain's Brawn", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Slag-Crusted Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StoneSkinTotem", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Magma-Warmed Blood", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Volcano", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Rule of the Biggest Club", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_BattleShout", text = "Your Strength is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Whoever Hits Hardest", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DecisiveStrike", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Cleave the enemy and the one beside it. Once every 8 sec.\n\nAmong the Ragefire troggs the chieftain is simply the one who swings widest. Oggleflint never stopped swinging." }, { name = "Cooled in the Magma", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FireArmor", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Ragefire Hide by 15 sec.\n\nA trogg who sleeps beside the lava river wakes with a crust on him. Oggleflint sleeps there every night." } }, tips = { [261] = "The chieftain calls, the tunnels answer: two Ragefire Troggs scramble out of the rock to fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Ragefire Chasm", expansion = 0, order = 24, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.39, 0.01, 0.94 }, title = "Ragefire Chieftain" },
    { id = "jergosh_the_invoker", entry = 11518, name = "Jergosh the Invoker", label = "Jergosh the Invoker", level = 16, display = 11429, height = 2.4, span = 2.4, school = "fire", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Immolation", profile = "caster", kit = { 20800, 12739, 18267, 12096, 11990, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Searing Blade Fire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Immolation", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Whispers of the Demon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Cultist's Fervour", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfMannoroth", text = "Your chance to critically strike with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Chasm Heat", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Volcano", text = "Reduces the mana cost of your Fire spells by 8%." }, { name = "The Fire Spreads", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to Immolate the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nThe Searing Blade brands its initiates with fire. Jergosh sees no reason to stop at initiates." }, { name = "Invocation of Flame", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RainOfFire", text = "Your Rain of Fire covers 20% more ground.\n\nThe invoker has called fire down on the chasm so often that the roof of Ragefire seems glad to let it fall." } }, tips = { [261] = "Your cultists heed the invocation: two Searing Blade Cultists join you and fight for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Ragefire Chasm", expansion = 0, order = 23, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { 0.01, -0.01, 1.18 }, title = "Invoker of the Searing Blade" },
    { id = "bazzalan", entry = 17338, name = "Bazzalan", label = "Bazzalan", level = 16, display = 2012, height = 2.4, span = 2.4, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_DualWeild", profile = "glass_cannon", kit = { 7159, 2818, 25809, 8699, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Fel-Steeped Blades", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_CorrosiveBreath", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Satyr's Guile", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_DualWeild", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Cloven Agility", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Sprint", text = "Your Agility is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Trickster's Footwork", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWard", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Venom in Every Cut", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_PoisonSting", text = "Your melee hits have a 15% chance to cripple the enemy, slowing it. Once every 6 sec.\n\nBazzalan taught the Searing Blade to poison its knives. He never needed to learn it himself." }, { name = "Demon's Own Venom", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Poison_06", text = "Your Fel Venom deals 15% more damage.\n\nThe satyrs drank from the Well before it burned. What is left of that magic curdles in their poisons." } }, tips = { [261] = "Your cult's muscle steps out of the smoke: two Searing Blade Enforcers fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, zone = "Bloodmyst Isle", expansion = 0, order = 16, as = 11519, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.66, -0.00, 1.17 }, view = { 1.9756, 0.0000, 0.0220 }, title = "Master of the Searing Blade" },
    { id = "taragaman_the_hungerer", entry = 11520, name = "Taragaman the Hungerer", label = "Taragaman the Hungerer", level = 16, display = 7970, height = 5.5, span = 5.5, school = "fire", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SummonFelGuard", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 11970, 18072, 7290, 13730 }, passives = { 21142 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Demonfire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Legion Plate", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SummonFelGuard", text = "Your armor is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Gorged on Souls", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_LifeDrain02", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Brute of the Twisting Nether", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your Strength is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Never Sated", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to feed The Hunger on the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nThe Searing Blade brought it offerings for years. Taragaman ate every one and asked for more." }, { name = "Flames of the Chasm", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SealOfFire", text = "Your Fire Nova reaches 20% farther.\n\nDown in Ragefire the magma answers any demon that calls it. Taragaman calls loudly." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Ragefire Chasm", expansion = 0, order = 25, box = { 0.26, -0.11, 2.73 }, title = "Demon of Ragefire Chasm" },
    { id = "lady_sarevess", entry = 4831, name = "Lady Sarevess", label = "Lady Sarevess", level = 23, display = 4979, height = 3.7, span = 3.7, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\inv_misc_nagafemale", profile = "caster", kit = { 8435, 15532, 246, 6660, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Storm of Blackfathom", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ChainLightning", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Cold of the Drowned Temple", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostNova", text = "Your Frost damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Siren Cadence", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Slow", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Scales of the Deep", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\inv_misc_nagafemale", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "The Deep Holds Them", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_ChainsOfIce", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to Slow the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nBlackfathom water is cold and heavy. Sarevess only needs to remind intruders how far down they are." }, { name = "Lightning on the Water", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", text = "Your Forked Lightning deals 15% more damage.\n\nThe flooded halls carry every spark. Sarevess learned to sing where the water is deepest." } }, tips = { [261] = "You should not be here! Slay them! Two Blackfathom Myrmidons rise from the water and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 5799, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackfathom Deeps", expansion = 0, order = 68, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.81, 0.01, 1.83 }, voices = { { 5799, 5.7, true, "You should not be here! Slay them!" }, { 5801, 2.9, true, "Paltry kill." } }, title = "Siren of Blackfathom" },
    { id = "ghamoo_ra", entry = 4887, name = "Ghamoo-ra", label = "Ghamoo-ra", level = 23, display = 5027, height = 3.6, span = 6.8, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Turtle", profile = "tank", kit = { 5568, 8391, 37486, 31731 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Temple Shell", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Turtle", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Centuries of Bulk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Bash", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Barnacled Plates", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Shell_01", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Immovable Guardian", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DefensiveStance", text = "The threat you generate is increased by 25%." }, { name = "Stamp the Intruders", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_WarStomp", text = "When you are hit you have a 10% chance to Trample the enemies around you. Once every 10 sec.\n\nGhamoo-ra is slow to anger and slower to move. Poke it often enough and the floor shakes." }, { name = "Older Than the Temple", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldWall", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Shell Shield by 30 sec.\n\nThe turtle was in Blackfathom before the night elves built it. It knows exactly when to pull its head in." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackfathom Deeps", expansion = 0, order = 67, box = { -1.60, -0.02, 1.68 }, view = { -2.0484, 0.0000, 0.5060 }, title = "Great Turtle of Blackfathom" },
    { id = "aku_mai", entry = 4829, name = "Aku'mai", label = "Aku'mai", level = 24, display = 2837, height = 14.8, span = 25.8, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\inv_hydra_02", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 15496, 3815, 9591, 3490, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Old God's Venom", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_CorrosiveBreath", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Hydra Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\inv_hydra_02", text = "Your armor is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Many Mouths to Feed", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_FerociousBite", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Fattened by the Cult", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyStrength", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Another Head Spits", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Acid_01", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Acid Spit at the target. Once every 8 sec.\n\nWhile two heads bite, the third is always looking for something to spit at." }, { name = "Breath of the Lair", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_PlagueCloud", text = "Your Poison Cloud spreads 25% farther.\n\nThe air in the lair of Aku'mai is thick and green. Nobody who breathes it asks why." } }, tips = { [261] = "The water churns: two Aku'mai Snapjaws surface from the lair and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackfathom Deeps", expansion = 0, order = 69, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -5.30, 1.75, 6.82 }, title = "Beloved of the Old Gods" },
    { id = "old_serra_kis", entry = 4830, name = "Old Serra'kis", label = "Old Serra'kis", level = 24, display = 1816, height = 6.9, span = 10.5, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_FerociousBite", profile = "glass_cannon", kit = { 254107, 13738, 34811, 22120, 8269 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Predator of the Deep", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_FerociousBite", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Ancient Hunter", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Rake", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Flooded Passages", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_Wisp", text = "Your movement speed is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Sleek Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Dash", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Nothing Escapes the Deep", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Gouge", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Rend the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nSerra'kis has had a century to learn that a bleeding thing always swims slower." }, { name = "Circling Hunter", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_SupriseAttack", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Deep Lunge by 5 sec.\n\nIn the dark water the old threshadon is never far away. It is only ever circling back." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackfathom Deeps", expansion = 0, order = 72, box = { -0.88, -0.05, 2.54 }, view = { -3.1391, 0.0000, 0.9130 }, title = "Terror of the Flooded Halls" },
    { id = "twilight_lord_kelris", entry = 4832, name = "Twilight Lord Kelris", label = "Twilight Lord Kelris", level = 24, display = 4939, height = 2.8, span = 2.8, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Twilight", profile = "caster", kit = { 15587, 16568, 11639, 8399, 11974, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Dust to Dust", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Deep Meditation", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Sleep", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Whispers Below", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Twilight", text = "Your chance to critically strike with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Discipline of the Hammer", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_PowerWordShield", text = "Reduces the mana cost of your Shadow spells by 8%." }, { name = "Pain Unending", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfSargeras", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to cast Shadow Word: Pain on the target. Once every 12 sec.\n\nKelris does not raise his voice. He lets the whispers of the Old Gods do the rest." }, { name = "The Dreaming Deep", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Dreamstate", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Sleep by 15 sec.\n\nSleep... The Twilight lord has sat so long beside the pet of the Old Gods that their dream seeps out of him." } }, tips = { [261] = "Who dares disturb my meditation? Two Twilight Acolytes leave the altar to heal and fight beside you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 5802, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackfathom Deeps", expansion = 0, order = 73, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { 0.01, -0.01, 1.41 }, voices = { { 5802, 2.8, true, "Who dares disturb my meditation?" }, { 5804, 1.8, true, "Sleep..." }, { 5803, 1.3, true, "Dust to dust." } }, title = "Twilight's Hammer" },
    { id = "gelihast", entry = 6243, name = "Gelihast", label = "Gelihast", level = 24, display = 1773, height = 2.6, span = 2.6, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Head_Murloc_01", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 6533, 8382, 15496, 39207, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Might of the Shrine Lord", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Head_Murloc_01", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Twin Sabres", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_DualWield", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Slippery Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_Wisp", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Giant Among Murlocs", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_BattleShout", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Tangled in the Shrine Nets", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Ensnare", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to Net the enemy in place. Once every 15 sec.\n\nThe shrine of Gelihast is strung with old nets. Anything that wades in tends to stay." }, { name = "Mrrgglll!", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Net_01", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Net by 5 sec.\n\nThe Blindlight murlocs mend his nets every night. There is always a fresh one ready to throw." } }, tips = { [261] = "A gurgling cry echoes through the shrine: two Blindlight Muckdwellers splash up and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackfathom Deeps", expansion = 0, order = 70, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.17, -0.00, 1.28 }, title = "Lord of the Blindlight Murlocs" },
    { id = "lorgus_jett", entry = 12902, name = "Lorgus Jett", label = "Lorgus Jett", level = 24, display = 12822, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", profile = "caster", kit = { 12167, 12058, 13281, 15499, 12550, 12491 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Storm of the Old Gods", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Twilight Fervour", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Twilight", text = "Your chance to critically strike with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Rhythm of the Stormcaller", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ChainLightning", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Tides of the Deep", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_MagicImmunity", text = "Your healing is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Rolling Thunder", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_LightningBolt", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to call down an extra Lightning Bolt. Once every 8 sec.\n\nThe Hammer taught Lorgus that every storm is a prayer. He prays loudly." }, { name = "Chain of the Storm", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StormReach", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Chain Lightning by 3 sec.\n\nDown in Blackfathom the water carries lightning from one fool to the next." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackfathom Deeps", expansion = 0, order = 71, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.00, 1.06 }, view = { -0.0998, 0.0000, 0.0000 }, title = "Twilight's Hammer Stormcaller" },
    { id = "rhahk_zor", entry = 644, name = "Rhahk'Zor", label = "Rhahk'Zor", level = 19, display = 14403, height = 3.3, span = 3.3, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Hammer_09", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 6304, 19132, 33661, 15593, 261, 13446 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Ogre Muscle", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_PunishingBlow", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Thick Ogre Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DefensiveStance", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Swing the Big Hammer", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Hammer_09", text = "Your Strength is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Rhahk'Zor Smash Good", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DecisiveStrike", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Crack the Rock", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Sunder", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Crush Armor on the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nThe foreman swings at rock all day. Armor is just softer rock." }, { name = "Foreman's Temper", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_WarStomp", text = "Your Rhahk'Zor Slam deals 15% more damage.\n\nSlow miners get the hammer. Slow intruders get it sooner." } }, tips = { [261] = "VanCleef pay big for you heads! Two Defias Miners drop their picks and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 5774, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Deadmines", expansion = 0, order = 31, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.03, -0.00, 1.65 }, voices = { { 5774, 3.1, true, "VanCleef pay big for you heads!" } }, title = "The Foreman" },
    { id = "gilnid", entry = 1763, name = "Gilnid", label = "Gilnid", level = 20, display = 7124, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "fire", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 5213, 13183, 4068, 11350, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Foundry Fire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Heatproof Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FireArmor", text = "Your Fire resistance is increased by 25." }, { name = "Goblin Know-How", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Gizmo_02", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Hammer and Anvil", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Hammer_20", text = "Your Strength is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Spilled Ladle", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_LavaSpawn", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to splash Molten Metal on the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nGilnid never carries a ladle without spilling it. He calls it quality control." }, { name = "Bigger Nozzle", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Musket_04", text = "Your Goblin Dragon Gun reaches 20% farther.\n\nEvery goblin engineer improves the dragon gun. Gilnid improved it by making the flame longer." } }, tips = { [261] = "Two Goblin Craftsmen down tools in the foundry and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Deadmines", expansion = 0, order = 36, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { 0.01, -0.04, 1.04 }, title = "The Smelter" },
    { id = "targorr_the_dread", entry = 1696, name = "Targorr the Dread", label = "Targorr the Dread", level = 24, display = 517, height = 2.8, span = 2.8, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 3391, 17547, 25821, 7372, 8599 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Blackrock Fury", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Twin Blades", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_DualWield", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Old Horde Brawn", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_BattleShout", text = "Your Strength is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Prison-Yard Scars", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DefensiveStance", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Nothing Left to Lose", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_GhoulFrenzy", text = "Your melee hits have a 6% chance to Thrash, gaining extra attacks. Once every 10 sec.\n\nThe guards took his clan, his axe and his freedom. Targorr kept only the swinging." }, { name = "Rattle the Bars", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_BloodRage", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your The Dread by 10 sec.\n\nEvery night the Stockade hears him. The Dread never quite sleeps." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Stormwind Stockade", expansion = 0, order = 75, box = { -0.06, -0.02, 1.41 }, title = "Blackrock Prisoner" },
    { id = "dextren_ward", entry = 1663, name = "Dextren Ward", label = "Dextren Ward", level = 25, display = 2149, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Spear_04", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 11976, 15589, 16001, 19134, 38959 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Killer's Precision", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Spear_04", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Long Reach", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Nothing to Lose", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_BattleShout", text = "Your attack power is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Hard Years in the Cells", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DefensiveStance", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Opened Veins", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Rupture", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to Impale the target. Once every 12 sec.\n\nDextren does not stop at one cut, and the guards know it." }, { name = "Every Guard Within Reach", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Weapon_Halberd_02", text = "Your Polearm Sweep reaches 20% farther.\n\nIn a crowded cell block a polearm reaches everyone. Dextren made sure the guards learned that." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Stormwind Stockade", expansion = 0, order = 77, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.00, 1.06 }, title = "Stockade Inmate" },
    { id = "kam_deepfury", entry = 1666, name = "Kam Deepfury", label = "Kam Deepfury", level = 25, display = 825, height = 1.6, span = 1.6, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Shield_05", profile = "tank", kit = { 8242, 1672, 3419, 70428, 7978 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Dark Iron Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Shield_05", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Dwarven Stubbornness", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DefensiveStance", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Behind the Shield", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Defend", text = "Your chance to block is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Forge-Hardened", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FireArmor", text = "Your Fire resistance is increased by 25." }, { name = "Bring Down the Span", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fireball", text = "When you are hit you have an 8% chance to throw a Demolition Charge. Once every 15 sec.\n\nKam swears he never lit a fuse on the Thandol Span. He lights them readily enough now." }, { name = "Walls of Shadowforge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldWall", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Improved Blocking by 10 sec.\n\nDark Iron dwarves grew up behind the walls of Shadowforge. Kam has never learned to stop hiding behind one." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Stormwind Stockade", expansion = 0, order = 78, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.02, 0.79 }, title = "Dark Iron Saboteur" },
    { id = "bazil_thredd", entry = 1716, name = "Bazil Thredd", label = "Bazil Thredd", level = 25, display = 1621, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bomb_08", profile = "glass_cannon", kit = { 15691, 34097, 7964, 9128, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Brotherhood Steel", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_DualWield", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Quick Hands", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_SliceDice", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Slippery Ringleader", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Feint", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Defias Cunning", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bandana_03", text = "Your Agility is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Every Cell a Weapon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Eviscerate", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to strike again with Ringleader's Cut. Once every 8 sec.\n\nBazil walked into the Stockade with nothing. He walked out of his cell with two sabres." }, { name = "Smoke on the Cell Block", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bomb_08", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Smoke Bomb by 15 sec.\n\nThe riot needed a signal. Bazil had a pocket full of them." } }, tips = { [261] = "The cells swing open: two Defias Convicts join your riot and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Stormwind Stockade", expansion = 0, order = 76, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.00, 1.06 }, title = "Defias Ringleader" },
    { id = "hamhock", entry = 891, name = "Hamhock", label = "Hamhock", level = 25, display = 326, height = 2.9, span = 2.9, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_BloodLust", profile = "caster", kit = { 15117, 6742, 15496, 12734 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Ogre Storm Mojo", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ChainLightning", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Big Belly", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Food_14", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Hungry Magic", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_BloodLust", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Two Meals a Day", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", text = "Reduces the mana cost of your Nature spells by 8%." }, { name = "Me Hit, Then Zap", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StormReach", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to set off Chain Lightning. Once every 10 sec.\n\nHamhock never learned which end of the cleaver the magic comes out of. Both work." }, { name = "More Blood, More Lust", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_BloodRage", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Bloodlust by 15 sec.\n\nAn ogre magus with a full belly is dangerous. Hamhock is never full, which is worse." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, zone = "Duskwood", expansion = 0, order = 90, as = 1717, box = { -0.03, -0.00, 1.43 }, title = "Ogre of the Stockade" },
    { id = "kresh", entry = 3653, name = "Kresh", label = "Kresh", level = 20, display = 5126, height = 2.4, span = 4.6, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Shell_03", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 35298, 29711, 9791, 30485 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Kresh's Back", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Shield_05", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Old Snapper", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Shell_03", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Cavern Waters", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_Wisp", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Unhurried Bite", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_FerociousBite", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Never Lets Go", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_MonsterFang_01", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Snap again. Once every 8 sec.\n\nKresh drifts through the caverns as if asleep. The jaws are always awake." }, { name = "Shell Like a Shield", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Turtle", text = "Your Snapping Jaws deal 15% more damage.\n\nAdventurers have spent years trying to turn Kresh into a shield. The ones who got close met the jaws first." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Wailing Caverns", expansion = 0, order = 51, box = { -1.07, -0.01, 1.12 }, title = "Snapper of the Wailing Caverns" },
    { id = "lord_pythas", entry = 3670, name = "Lord Pythas", label = "Lord Pythas", level = 20, display = 4214, height = 3.1, span = 3.1, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Axe_02", profile = "caster", kit = { 17158, 8147, 19970, 8040, 23381 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Storm of the Fang", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Serpent's Patience", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Sleep", text = "Your chance to critically strike with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Twisted Dream", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_HealingTouch", text = "Your healing is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Scaled Skin", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StoneClawTotem", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "The Coils Tighten", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StrangleVines", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to bind the target in Coils of Death. Once every 20 sec.\n\nPythas dreams of serpents now, and whatever he strikes starts to feel their coils." }, { name = "Thunder in the Caverns", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ThunderClap", text = "Your Thunderclap reaches 20% farther.\n\nThe Wailing Caverns carry every sound far into the dark. Pythas makes them carry thunder." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 5787, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Wailing Caverns", expansion = 0, order = 55, charModel = true, box = { -0.24, 0.01, 1.55 }, voices = { { 5787, 3.5, true, "The coils of death will crush you!" } }, title = "Fanglord" },
    { id = "lady_anacondra", entry = 3671, name = "Lady Anacondra", label = "Lady Anacondra", level = 20, display = 4313, height = 2.3, span = 2.3, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Rejuvenation", profile = "caster", kit = { 9532, 20790, 8070, 8148, 8040, 21791 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Serpent Lord's Grace", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_HealingTouch", text = "Your healing is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Fang's Lightning", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Dreamer's Thrift", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Rejuvenation", text = "Reduces the mana cost of your Nature spells by 8%." }, { name = "Thorny Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Thorns", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Wrath of the Serpent Lords", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_LightningBolt", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to call down another Lightning Bolt. Once every 10 sec.\n\nAnacondra learned the storm from Naralex. She turned it on everyone who came to wake him." }, { name = "None Can Stand", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StrangleVines", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Thorns Aura by 10 sec.\n\nNone can stand against the Serpent Lords, and none who strike them walk away unscratched." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 5786, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Wailing Caverns", expansion = 0, order = 52, charModel = true, box = { -0.15, 0.10, 1.14 }, voices = { { 5786, 3.0, true, "None can stand against the Serpent Lords!" } }, title = "Fanglord" },
    { id = "skum", entry = 3674, name = "Skum", label = "Skum", level = 20, display = 4203, height = 6.1, span = 12.4, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Crocolisk", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 6254, 20627, 12612, 25654 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Storm in the Blood", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Thick Lizard Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Crocolisk", text = "Your armor is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Grounded", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_LightningShield", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 25." }, { name = "Deviate Growth", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Regeneration", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Static Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_WindSerpent", text = "When you are hit you have a 10% chance to breathe Lightning Breath at the attacker. Once every 8 sec.\n\nSkum carries so much charge that anything touching it gets a jolt back." }, { name = "Chain of the Caverns", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ChainLightning", text = "Your Chained Bolt arcs to 1 more enemy.\n\nIn the wet dark of the caverns lightning never stops at the first body." } }, tips = { [25654] = "Whip your tail around you, stunning nearby enemies for 2 sec and dealing 875 damage." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Wailing Caverns", expansion = 0, order = 58, box = { -2.54, -0.25, 3.02 }, title = "Thunder Lizard of the Caverns" },
    { id = "verdan_the_everliving", entry = 5775, name = "Verdan the Everliving", label = "Verdan the Everliving", level = 20, display = 4256, height = 13.6, span = 21.1, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StrangleVines", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 8142, 7342, 22373, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Nightmare Bloom", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StrangleVines", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Everliving Growth", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Regeneration", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Bark and Bog", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StoneClawTotem", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Green Mending", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Rejuvenation", text = "Your healing is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Roots Everywhere", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to lash out in a Wide Slash. Once every 12 sec.\n\nCut one vine and two grow back. Verdan is the whole cavern floor, and it is always reaching." }, { name = "It Always Grows Back", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Tranquility", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Everliving by 10 sec.\n\nThey call it the Everliving for a reason. Nobody who has fought it has seen it stay hurt." } }, tips = { [261] = "The Nightmare blooms around you: two Deviate Lashers sprout from the cavern floor and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Wailing Caverns", expansion = 0, order = 59, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 2.12, -1.02, 5.99 }, title = "The Everliving" },
    { id = "razorclaw_the_butcher", entry = 3886, name = "Razorclaw the Butcher", label = "Razorclaw the Butcher", level = 20, display = 524, height = 2.6, span = 2.6, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\inv_misc_1h_innmeatcleaver_a_01", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 16856, 16509, 7372, 7485 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Butcher's Hands", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\inv_misc_1h_innmeatcleaver_a_01", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Knows Where to Cut", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_BackStab", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Well Fed", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Food_14", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Worgen Brawn", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_WhiteDireWolf", text = "Your Strength is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Another for the Pot", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Gouge", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Hack the target, making it bleed. Once every 10 sec.\n\nRazorclaw never wastes a cut. Everything that bleeds ends up in the kitchen." }, { name = "Sharpened Cleavers", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your Butcher's Carve deals 15% more damage.\n\nThe butcher sharpens his claws on the kitchen whetstone every night, whether Arugal feeds him or not." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Shadowfang Keep", expansion = 0, order = 45, box = { 0.03, -0.06, 1.32 }, title = "Butcher of Shadowfang" },
    { id = "rethilgore", entry = 3853, name = "Rethilgore", label = "Rethilgore", level = 20, display = 729, height = 2.3, span = 2.3, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Key_03", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 7295, 30980, 27553, 24187 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Jailer's Grip", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Key_03", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Soul Hunger", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_LifeDrain02", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Keeper's Vigil", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_WhiteDireWolf", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Worgen Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DefensiveStance", text = "Your armor is increased by 12%." }, { name = "No Prisoner Escapes", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Haunting", text = "Your melee hits have a 6% chance to Soul Drain the target, rooting it. Once every 20 sec.\n\nRethilgore has never let a prisoner walk out of his cells. The Deathstalkers are still waiting." }, { name = "Iron-Shod Claws", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_MonsterClaw_03", text = "Your Claw deals 15% more damage.\n\nThe cell keeper files his claws on the bars every night. The prisoners hear it and do not sleep." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Shadowfang Keep", expansion = 0, order = 42, as = 3914, box = { 0.02, -0.05, 1.15 }, title = "The Cell Keeper" },
    { id = "commander_springvale", entry = 4278, name = "Commander Springvale", label = "Commander Springvale", level = 20, display = 3223, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "holy", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_SealOfMight", profile = "tank", kit = { 13953, 37369, 32773, 70428, 13952, 33581 }, passives = { 8258 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Plate of the Keep", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Chest_Plate06", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Commander's Resolve", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_DevotionAura", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Behind the Kite Shield", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Shield_06", text = "Your chance to block is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Light Turned Cold", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_HolyBolt", text = "Your Holy damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Hammer of the Keep", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_SealOfMight", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to deliver an extra Holy Strike. Once every 10 sec.\n\nSpringvale still fights with a paladin's training. He simply no longer asks the Light whose side it is on." }, { name = "Hold the Gate", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_InnerFire", text = "Your Consecration covers 25% more ground.\n\nThe commander was given one order by Arugal: hold the keep. He blesses every stone of it." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 154, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Shadowfang Keep", expansion = 0, order = 44, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.00, 1.06 }, title = "Commander of the Keep" },
    { id = "wolf_master_nandos", entry = 3927, name = "Wolf Master Nandos", label = "Wolf Master Nandos", level = 21, display = 11179, height = 3.4, span = 3.4, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Wolf", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 43356, 44622, 24187, 30636, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Leader of the Pack", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Wolf", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Kennel Brawler", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Rake", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Hunter's Stride", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Dash", text = "Your movement speed is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Thick Worgen Pelt", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_WhiteDireWolf", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Drag Down the Prey", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_ShockWave", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Tendon Rip the target, slowing it. Once every 10 sec.\n\nThe wolf master teaches every worg the same lesson: go for the legs, and the rest follows." }, { name = "Kennels Never Empty", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_DemoralizingRoar", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Wolf Master's Howl by 10 sec.\n\nThere is always another worg in Arugal's kennels, and every one of them answers Nandos." } }, tips = { [261] = "Whistle up the kennels: two Bleak Worgs bound out of the dark and hunt at your side for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Shadowfang Keep", expansion = 0, order = 50, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.03, -0.07, 1.72 }, title = "Wolf Master" },
    { id = "fenrus_the_devourer", entry = 4274, name = "Fenrus the Devourer", label = "Fenrus the Devourer", level = 21, display = 20180, height = 3.8, span = 7.8, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_BlackDireWolf", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 7125, 16495, 51772, 16508 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Endless Appetite", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_FerociousBite", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Toxic Maw", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_CorrosiveBreath", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Dire Wolf Bulk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_BlackDireWolf", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Pack Killer", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Rake", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Saliva in Every Bite", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Poison_02", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to leave Toxic Saliva in the wound. Once every 15 sec.\n\nFenrus does not chew his food. What it does not swallow whole, it poisons." }, { name = "Always Hungry", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Devour by 4 sec.\n\nThey call it the Devourer because nobody has ever seen it full." } }, tips = { [51772] = "Rake an enemy with your great claws, dealing normal damage plus 35." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Shadowfang Keep", expansion = 0, order = 47, box = { -0.72, -0.03, 1.85 }, title = "The Devourer" },
    { id = "odo_the_blindwatcher", entry = 4279, name = "Odo the Blindwatcher", label = "Odo the Blindwatcher", level = 21, display = 522, height = 3.0, span = 3.0, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 8281, 9633, 17156, 7483 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Hunts by Ear", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Fury of the Watch", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Never Sleeps", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_WhiteDireWolf", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Rampart Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DefensiveStance", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Heard You Coming", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Whirlwind", text = "When you are hit you have a 10% chance to lash out with a Blind Swipe. Once every 10 sec.\n\nOdo cannot see the blow coming. He hears it, and he answers the sound." }, { name = "Howl Louder", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_ChallangingRoar", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Howling Rage by 10 sec.\n\nEvery packmate that falls makes the blind watchman howl louder. By the end, the whole keep can hear him." } }, tips = { [9633] = "Swipe blindly at everything around you, striking each nearby enemy for normal damage plus 5.", [7483] = "Howling Rage: you and nearby allies are swollen with fury, dealing 20 more Physical damage per hit for 5 min." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Shadowfang Keep", expansion = 0, order = 48, box = { 0.03, -0.06, 1.49 }, title = "Watchman of Shadowfang" },
    { id = "roogug", entry = 6168, name = "Roogug", label = "Roogug", level = 26, display = 6110, height = 2.9, span = 2.9, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EarthQuake", profile = "caster", kit = { 9532, 15501, 6524, 3600 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Voice of the Stone", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EarthQuake", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Thornhide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Thorns", text = "Your armor is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Geomancer's Focus", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EarthShock", text = "Your chance to critically strike with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Rooted in the Kraul", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StrengthOfEarthTotem02", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Aftershock", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EarthBind", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to Earthbind the enemies around you. Once every 10 sec.\n\nWhen Roogug calls on the earth it keeps answering long after the spell is done." }, { name = "Voice of the Earth", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_TremorTotem", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Earth Shock by 4 sec.\n\nThe Kraul is built on restless ground. Roogug only has to remind it who speaks for it." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Razorfen Kraul", expansion = 0, order = 80, box = { -0.13, 0.01, 1.44 }, title = "Razorfen Geomancer" },
    { id = "overlord_ramtusk", entry = 4420, name = "Overlord Ramtusk", label = "Overlord Ramtusk", level = 27, display = 4652, height = 4.1, span = 4.1, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Head_Quillboar_01", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 15548, 15576, 24408, 9128, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Might of Agamaggan", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Head_Quillboar_01", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Twin Axes", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_DualWield", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Bristleback Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Thorns", text = "Your armor is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Overlord's Bulk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_BattleShout", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Thunder of the Kraul", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ThunderClap", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to set off a Thunderclap. Once every 12 sec.\n\nRamtusk does not stop to cast. The thunder of Agamaggan simply follows his axes." }, { name = "Victory!", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_WarCry", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your For Agamaggan! by 10 sec.\n\nVictory! For Agamaggan! The Kraul has heard the cry a thousand times and still charges at it." } }, tips = { [261] = "Two Razorfen Warriors answer the overlord's call and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 5812, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Razorfen Kraul", expansion = 0, order = 85, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.69, 0.01, 2.03 }, voices = { { 5812, 4.9, true, "Victory! For Agamaggan!" } }, title = "Overlord of Razorfen Kraul" },
    { id = "charlga_razorflank", entry = 4421, name = "Charlga Razorflank", label = "Charlga Razorflank", level = 27, display = 4642, height = 3.4, span = 3.4, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ChainLightning", profile = "caster", kit = { 8292, 13338, 8362, 8361, 8358 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Crone's Lightning", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ChainLightning", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Old Cunning", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfTounges", text = "Your chance to critically strike with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Blessing of the Thorns", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Renew", text = "Your healing is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Hoarded Mana", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ManaRegenTotem", text = "Reduces the mana cost of your Nature spells by 8%." }, { name = "Troublesome Whelps", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to loose another Chain Bolt. Once every 12 sec.\n\nTroublesome whelps. Charlga has taught a great many of them not to interfere." }, { name = "My Power Rules Here", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Rejuvenation", text = "Reduces the mana cost of your Renew by 30%.\n\nThe crone has ruled the Kraul for longer than any of its warriors have lived, and she means to keep ruling." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 5815, soundDeath = 5818, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Razorfen Kraul", expansion = 0, order = 83, box = { -0.16, 0.01, 1.68 }, voices = { { 5813, 4.2, true, "Troublesome whelps. I'll teach you to interfere!" }, { 5814, 1.1, true, "Who's next?" }, { 5815, 4.3, true, "You outsiders will pay for encroaching on our land!" }, { 5816, 3.4, true, "Bah! My power rules here!" }, { 5818, 2.8, true, "Our new allies will avenge us!" } }, title = "The Crone" },
    { id = "agathelos_the_raging", entry = 4422, name = "Agathelos the Raging", label = "Agathelos the Raging", level = 27, display = 2450, height = 6.4, span = 8.8, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Boar", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 8285, 8555, 4102, 30485 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Blood of Agamaggan", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Boar", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "War Barding", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DefensiveStance", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Great Boar Bulk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Bash", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Never Calmed", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_ChallangingRoar", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Tusks Everywhere", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Horn_01", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Gore the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nAgathelos does not aim. With tusks that size it does not have to." }, { name = "The Raging", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Enrage", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Enrage by 10 sec.\n\nThe quilboar named it the Raging for a reason. Nothing in the Kraul has ever seen it calm." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Razorfen Kraul", expansion = 0, order = 81, box = { 0.95, 0.01, 3.10 }, view = { -4.5000, 0.0000, 0.7260 }, title = "Great Boar of the Kraul" },
    { id = "aggem_thorncurse", entry = 4424, name = "Aggem Thorncurse", label = "Aggem Thorncurse", level = 27, display = 6097, height = 3.2, span = 3.2, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", profile = "caster", kit = { 16583, 6909, 13321, 16588, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Prophet of Death", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Cursed Thorns", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Thorns", text = "Your chance to critically strike with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Dark Mending", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ChillTouch", text = "Your healing is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Bristled Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Head_Quillboar_01", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Grave Chill", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyFrenzy", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to send another Shadow Shock at the target. Once every 8 sec.\n\nAggem has seen the future of the Kraul, and it is cold." }, { name = "Prophecy of Thorns", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfSargeras", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Thorncurse by 10 sec.\n\nThe prophet has seen every enemy of the Kraul wrapped in thorns. He is only hurrying the prophecy along." } }, tips = { [261] = "Call back the spirit of a slain war boar: a Boar Spirit fights for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Razorfen Kraul", expansion = 0, order = 82, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.08, 0.02, 1.57 }, title = "Death's Head Prophet" },
    { id = "death_speaker_jargba", entry = 4428, name = "Death Speaker Jargba", label = "Death Speaker Jargba", level = 27, display = 4644, height = 3.8, span = 3.8, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathCoil", profile = "caster", kit = { 9613, 15654, 32709, 14515, 17204 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Voice of the Dead", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Captain's Plating", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Head_Quillboar_01", text = "Your armor is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Cold Conviction", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathCoil", text = "Your chance to critically strike with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Grave Endurance", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Words of Death", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to speak Shadow Word: Pain on the target. Once every 12 sec.\n\nJargba does not shout orders. He speaks, quietly, and the living start to die." }, { name = "Death Speaks Often", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathScream", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Death Coil by 10 sec.\n\nThe Scourge gave the death speaker a new voice, and he has grown fond of using it." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Razorfen Kraul", expansion = 0, order = 84, summons = { [17204] = true }, box = { -0.64, 0.01, 1.90 }, title = "Death's Head Captain" },
    { id = "lord_roccor", entry = 9025, name = "Lord Roccor", label = "Lord Roccor", level = 51, display = 5781, height = 4.0, span = 5.1, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Earthquake", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 13728, 13729, 6524, 23391, 22693 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Tremor Lord", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EarthShock", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Fire in the Stone", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FlameShock", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Black Rock Plating", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StoneSkinTotem", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Weight of the Mountain", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Earthquake", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Veins of Fire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Immolation", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Flame Shock the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nThe Dark Irons woke the fire under their quarries. Every blow from Roccor leaves it smouldering." }, { name = "Restless Depths", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_TremorTotem", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Ground Tremor by 10 sec.\n\nThe halls of Blackrock Depths never stop shaking while their stone lord walks them." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 153, box = { -0.02, -0.07, 1.84 }, title = "Lord of Burning Stone" },
    { id = "bael_gar", entry = 9016, name = "Bael'Gar", label = "Bael'Gar", level = 52, display = 12162, height = 13.5, span = 14.3, school = "fire", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Volcano", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 13880, 19364, 11970, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Living Magma", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Volcano", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Obsidian Crust", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StoneSkinTotem", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Giant's Bulk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Born of Fire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FireArmor", text = "Your Fire resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Molten Blood", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SelfDestruct", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to set off a Magma Eruption around you. Once every 10 sec.\n\nCut Bael'Gar and he bleeds magma; whoever stands close enough burns for it." }, { name = "Cracked Floor", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_WarStomp", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Molten Stomp by 10 sec.\n\nEvery step the chained giant takes cracks the cavern floor a little further." } }, tips = { [261] = "Tear loose pieces of your molten body: two Spawn of Bael'Gar rise to fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 154, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.16, -0.12, 6.70 }, title = "Molten Giant of the Depths" },
    { id = "high_interrogator_gerstahn", entry = 9018, name = "High Interrogator Gerstahn", label = "High Interrogator Gerstahn", level = 52, display = 8761, height = 2.3, span = 2.3, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", profile = "caster", kit = { 14032, 16568, 14033, 13704, 12040 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Word of Pain", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Practiced Cruelty", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Patient Questioner", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ManaBurn", text = "The mana cost of your Shadow spells is reduced by 8%." }, { name = "Twilight Warding", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Confession", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfSargeras", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to lay Shadow Word: Pain on the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nIn the cells of the Detention Block, every answer Gerstahn gets comes with a little more pain." }, { name = "Screams in the Cells", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_PsychicScream", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Psychic Scream by 15 sec.\n\nThe prisoners of Blackrock Depths learned to dread the sound of her voice." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 155, charModel = true, box = { -0.13, 0.01, 1.15 }, title = "Twilight's Hammer Interrogator" },
    { id = "pyromancer_loregrain", entry = 9024, name = "Pyromancer Loregrain", label = "Pyromancer Loregrain", level = 52, display = 8762, height = 2.3, span = 2.3, school = "fire", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SealOfFire", profile = "caster", kit = { 15095, 15616, 12470, 15041 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Pyromancy", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fireball02", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Quickened Flame", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Searing Focus", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SoulBurn", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Fire-Tempered Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FireArmor", text = "Your Fire resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Kindled Fury", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FlameShock", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to Flame Shock the target. Once every 12 sec.\n\nLoregrain's fire does not go out when the spell ends. It keeps burning in whoever it touched." }, { name = "Molten Lore", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SealOfFire", text = "Increases the damage of Molten Blast by 15%.\n\nThe pyromancer learned his craft from the Firelord's own servants, deep under the mountain." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 157, charModel = true, box = { -0.04, -0.00, 1.12 }, title = "Flamecaller of the Shadowforge" },
    { id = "houndmaster_grebmar", entry = 9319, name = "Houndmaster Grebmar", label = "Houndmaster Grebmar", level = 52, display = 9212, height = 1.6, span = 1.6, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Wolf", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 15615, 16075, 13730, 21049, 261, 13446 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Twin Hatchets", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Snapping Pace", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Go for the Throat", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_SavageBlow", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Kennel-Hardened", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_WarCry", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Scent of Blood", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Bloodlust", text = "Your melee hits have a 5% chance to send you into Bloodlust. Once every 45 sec.\n\nGrebmar's hounds catch the smell first, then Grebmar does. Neither of them lets go." }, { name = "Short Leash", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Hyena", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Hatchet Toss by 5 sec.\n\nA houndmaster learns to throw fast, before the dogs get there first." } }, tips = { [261] = "Slip the leashes: two Bloodhound Mastiffs bound out of the kennels and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 156, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.02, 0.79 }, title = "Kennelmaster of the Detention Block" },
    { id = "fineous_darkvire", entry = 9056, name = "Fineous Darkvire", label = "Fineous Darkvire", level = 53, display = 8704, height = 1.6, span = 1.6, school = "holy", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Hammer_20", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 13953, 15493, 11978, 15346, 13005 }, passives = { 8258 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Consecrated Stone", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_HolySmite", text = "Your Holy damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Load-Bearing Design", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_DevotionAura", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Light of the Forge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_HolyBolt", text = "Your healing done is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Measured Stroke", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_SealOfMight", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Hammer and Chisel", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Hammer_20", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to set off a Holy Strike. Once every 10 sec.\n\nFineous builds the way he fights: every blow of the maul lands exactly where he drew it." }, { name = "Plans for Everything", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_FistOfJustice", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Hammer of Justice by 10 sec.\n\nIronfoe is gone from his workshop, but the chief architect always keeps a spare hammer." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 154, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 158, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.02, 0.79 }, title = "Chief Architect" },
    { id = "warder_stilgiss", entry = 9041, name = "Warder Stilgiss", label = "Warder Stilgiss", level = 54, display = 9089, height = 1.9, span = 1.9, school = "frost", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostArmor02", profile = "caster", kit = { 12675, 12674, 15044, 261 }, passives = { 12556 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Vault Chill", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostBolt02", text = "Your Frost damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Cold Precision", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_Glacier", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Rime Ward", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostWard", text = "Your Frost resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Keeper's Vigil", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostArmor02", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Chill of the Vault", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_Frostbolt", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to loose a Frostbolt at the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nNothing leaves the Dark Iron vault warm. Stilgiss sees to that." }, { name = "Locked Tight", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostNova", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Frost Nova by 5 sec.\n\nThieves who reach the vault door find their boots frozen to the floor before they reach the lock." } }, tips = { [261] = "Unchain Verek, the vault's hound, to fight at your side for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 4991, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 160, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.12, -0.02, 0.95 }, title = "Warder of the Vault" },
    { id = "princess_moira_bronzebeard", entry = 8929, name = "Princess Moira Bronzebeard", label = "Princess Moira Bronzebeard", level = 55, display = 8705, height = 1.5, span = 1.5, school = "holy", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Achievement_Character_Dwarf_Female", profile = "caster", kit = { 15587, 15586, 8362, 17139, 15585 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Grace of the Bronzebeards", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Heal", text = "Your healing done is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Shadow of the Emperor", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Royal Composure", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Renew", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Dwarven Resilience", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_PowerWordShield", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Devoted Bride", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_BlessingOfProtection", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Power Word: Shield by 5 sec.\n\nWhatever Ironforge thinks of her choice, Moira shields the Emperor before she shields herself." }, { name = "Heir of Two Thrones", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_PrayerOfHealing02", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Prayer of the Shadowforge by 10 sec.\n\nDaughter of Magni, wife of Dagran: the princess prays for two kingdoms at once." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 154, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 166, charModel = true, box = { -0.12, 0.00, 0.76 }, title = "Princess of Ironforge" },
    { id = "golem_lord_argelmach", entry = 8983, name = "Golem Lord Argelmach", label = "Golem Lord Argelmach", level = 55, display = 8759, height = 1.8, span = 1.8, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Gizmo_01", profile = "caster", kit = { 15605, 15305, 15507, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Galvanic Current", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Arc Welder", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ChainLightning", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Assembly Line", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Gizmo_01", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Riveted Leathers", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Gear_08", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Static Discharge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_LightningShield", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Shock your attacker. Once every 10 sec.\n\nArgelmach wires everything he builds, himself included. Touch him and the current bites back." }, { name = "Overcharged Coils", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_LightningOverload", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Chain Lightning by 3 sec.\n\nThe golem lord keeps his coils charged past what any dwarf engineer would call safe." } }, tips = { [261] = "My constructs will destroy you! Two Ragereaver Golems lurch off the Manufactory line and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 164, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.11, -0.02, 0.87 }, title = "Master of the Manufactory" },
    { id = "anger_rel", entry = 9035, name = "Anger'rel", label = "Anger'rel", level = 55, display = 8686, height = 3.2, span = 3.2, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldWall", profile = "tank", kit = { 15580, 11971, 11972, 12169, 15062, 37548 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Unbroken Guard", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Defend", text = "Your chance to block is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Tomb-Iron Skin", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Shield_05", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Bound by the Summoning", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_WarCry", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Burning Grudge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_BloodRage", text = "The threat you cause is increased by 30%." }, { name = "Wrath of the Seven", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Sunder", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Strike back at your attacker. Once every 10 sec.\n\nAnger'rel was the first of the Seven to fall to the Emperor's summoning, and he never forgave it." }, { name = "Last Wall of the Tomb", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_ShieldWall", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Shield Wall by 30 sec.\n\nYou have challenged the Seven. Anger'rel holds the line until the others rise." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 162, charModel = true, box = { -0.20, -0.03, 1.58 }, title = "Shield of the Seven" },
    { id = "ambassador_flamelash", entry = 9156, name = "Ambassador Flamelash", label = "Ambassador Flamelash", level = 55, display = 8329, height = 3.1, span = 3.1, school = "fire", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 13342, 18958, 11988, 261 }, passives = { 14744 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Ambassador of Flame", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Searing Envoy", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SoulBurn", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Salamander Scales", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FireArmor", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Child of the Firelands", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SealOfFire", text = "Your Fire resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Trident of the Firelord", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fire", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Fire Blast the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nFlamelash speaks for Ragnaros in the halls of the Dark Irons, and his trident speaks louder." }, { name = "Reign of Terror", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FlameShock", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Flame Lash by 3 sec.\n\nFace your doom, mortals! The envoy's whip never cools between strokes." } }, tips = { [261] = "The runes of the dwarven chamber burn: two Burning Spirits answer the Firelord's envoy and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 161, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.44, -0.01, 1.48 }, title = "Envoy of Ragnaros" },
    { id = "phalanx", entry = 9502, name = "Phalanx", label = "Phalanx", level = 55, display = 8177, height = 5.0, span = 5.3, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Gear_08", profile = "tank", kit = { 14099, 15588, 22425, 22693, 37548 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Riveted Plating", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Gear_08", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Stone Core", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StoneSkinTotem", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Unfeeling Construct", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Defend", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Bar Enforcer", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_WarCry", text = "The threat you cause is increased by 30%." }, { name = "Thunder in the Tavern", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ThunderClap", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to set off a Thunderclap. Once every 12 sec.\n\nStart a brawl in the Grim Guzzler and Phalanx finishes it, whoever threw the first mug." }, { name = "Closing Time", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_SavageBlow", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Mighty Blow by 5 sec.\n\nThe Grim Guzzler closes when Phalanx says it does, and the doors are wherever he throws you." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 165, box = { 0.79, -0.20, 2.48 }, title = "Guardian of the Grim Guzzler" },
    { id = "gloom_rel", entry = 9037, name = "Gloom'rel", label = "Gloom'rel", level = 56, display = 8689, height = 3.2, span = 3.2, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Trade_Mining", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 15708, 15284, 9080, 9128 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Dark Iron Edge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_SavageBlow", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Miner's Eye", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Trade_Mining", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Pick and Blade", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Arms of the Forge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_WarCry", text = "Your Strength is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Gloom's Grip", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Slow", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to Hamstring the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nGloom'rel will teach you to smelt dark iron, if you pay. If you fight him, he teaches you to limp." }, { name = "Tempered in the Tomb", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DecisiveStrike", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Mortal Strike by 2 sec.\n\nCenturies bound in the Tomb of the Seven have not dulled the miner's swing." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 169, charModel = true, box = { -0.20, -0.03, 1.58 }, title = "Smelter of the Seven" },
    { id = "doom_rel", entry = 9039, name = "Doom'rel", label = "Doom'rel", level = 56, display = 8687, height = 3.2, span = 3.2, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfMannoroth", profile = "caster", kit = { 15537, 15245, 12742, 12493, 261 }, passives = { 13787 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Doom of the Seven", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Tomb Fire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Immolation", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Warlock's Certainty", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfMannoroth", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Chant of the Seven", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_GatherShadows", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Challenge Answered", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to Immolate the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nChallenge the Seven and Doom'rel answers first, with fire and shadow both." }, { name = "Seven as One", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Shadowfury", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Shadow Bolt Volley by 5 sec.\n\nWhen the Seven rise together, their leader's volleys fall like a storm on the tomb." } }, tips = { [261] = "Call the Seven's voidwalkers: two Voidwalker Minions rise from the tomb and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 167, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.20, -0.03, 1.58 }, title = "Leader of the Seven" },
    { id = "magmus", entry = 9938, name = "Magmus", label = "Magmus", level = 56, display = 12162, height = 13.5, span = 14.3, school = "fire", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Ragnaros_LavaBolt", profile = "tank", kit = { 15593, 15668, 15529, 21857, 37548 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Molten Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FireArmor", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Mountain of Magma", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Volcano", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Forged in the Core", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SealOfFire", text = "Your Fire resistance is increased by 60." }, { name = "Doorwarden", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_WarCry", text = "The threat you cause is increased by 30%." }, { name = "Molten Retort", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SelfDestruct", text = "When you are struck, you have an 8% chance to set off a Fiery Burst. Once every 15 sec.\n\nThe braziers of the Iron Hall are lit. Anyone who strikes Magmus gets burned for the trouble." }, { name = "None Shall Pass", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_WarStomp", text = "Reduces the cooldown of War Stomp by 10 sec.\n\nEmperor Thaurissan does not wish to be disturbed, and Magmus makes very sure he is not." } }, tips = { [21857] = "Wrap yourself in molten rock until cancelled: melee attackers take Fire damage and nearby enemies have their mana burned away." }, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Blackrock Depths", expansion = 0, order = 170, box = { 0.16, -0.12, 6.70 }, title = "Guardian of the Iron Hall" },
    { id = "zevrim_thornhoof", entry = 11490, name = "Zevrim Thornhoof", label = "Zevrim Thornhoof", level = 57, display = 11335, height = 5.6, span = 5.6, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathPact", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 22478, 16608, 32023, 29577 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Blood Rite", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathPact", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Fel Certainty", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Satyr's Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Fed by the Altar", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_LifeDrain", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Hungry Altar", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RitualOfSacrifice", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to Sacrifice the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nZevrim's altar is never satisfied. Every victim the satyr strikes is a step closer to it." }, { name = "Endless Offering", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Intense Pain by 10 sec.\n\nThe satyr who betrayed the ancients offers up pain as freely as he once offered prayers." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 205, box = { -1.55, -0.00, 2.76 }, title = "Priest of the Sacrifice" },
    { id = "hydrospawn", entry = 13280, name = "Hydrospawn", label = "Hydrospawn", level = 57, display = 5489, height = 4.7, span = 5.9, school = "frost", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_SummonWaterElemental", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 31012, 22419, 10987, 22420, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Cold Current", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostBolt02", text = "Your Frost damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Deep Water", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_SummonWaterElemental", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Clear as Glass", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_Glacier", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Body of Water", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_FrostWard", text = "Your Frost resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Undertow", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_Wisp", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to hurl a Water Bolt at your attacker. Once every 10 sec.\n\nStrike the water and it strikes back. The Warpwood pools do not stay still for anyone." }, { name = "Rising Tide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shaman_TidalWaves", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Riptide by 10 sec.\n\nThe Highborne's magic keeps the pool churning long after the fountain should have run dry." } }, tips = { [22419] = "Loose a riptide around you, dealing 85 Frost damage to every enemy near you, knocking them back and tearing their weapons from their hands for 4 sec.", [261] = "Split off pieces of yourself: two Hydrolings rise from the water and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 4991, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 203, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.01, 0.00, 2.98 }, title = "Spawn of the Warpwood Pools" },
    { id = "lethtendris", entry = 14327, name = "Lethtendris", label = "Lethtendris", level = 57, display = 21012, height = 2.4, span = 2.4, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SummonImp", profile = "caster", kit = { 22709, 14887, 20787, 13338, 17682, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Void Hunger", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Stolen Fire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Immolation", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Pylon-Fed", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SiphonMana", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Sin'dorei Precision", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Metamorphosis", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Kindled Addiction", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to Immolate the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nLethtendris came for the pylons' power and never stopped wanting more of it." }, { name = "Web of Energies", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SummonImp", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Void Bolt by 3 sec.\n\nWith the pylon energy caught in her web, the warlock's void bolts come faster than before." } }, tips = { [261] = "Call Pimgib, your imp, to fight at your side for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 204, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.09, -0.04, 1.21 }, title = "Hunter of the Pylons" },
    { id = "alzzin_the_wildshaper", entry = 11492, name = "Alzzin the Wildshaper", label = "Alzzin the Wildshaper", level = 58, display = 14416, height = 6.9, span = 6.9, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_NatureTouchDecay", profile = "caster", kit = { 22662, 22661, 22128, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Corrupted Wilds", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_NatureTouchDecay", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Quick Change", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Regeneration", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Rot at the Root", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AbominationExplosion", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Warpwood Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Thorns", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Spreading Blight", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Disease_02", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to Wither the target. Once every 20 sec.\n\nEverything Alzzin touches in the Warpwood sickens, and the sickness spreads." }, { name = "Thorn Bramble", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StrangleVines", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Thorns by 10 sec.\n\nThe Wildshaper grows thorns as easily as other satyrs grow horns." } }, tips = { [22662] = "Wither an enemy with corrupted nature for 740 Nature damage and 139 more every 3 sec. for 21 sec, sapping its attributes.", [22661] = "Sap the vigor of an enemy, draining its power every 1 sec. for 10 sec.", [261] = "Call your minions out of the Warpwood: three of Alzzin's Minions answer and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 206, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -1.94, -0.00, 3.45 }, title = "Corrupter of the Warpwood", visages = { "alzzin_wolf", "alzzin_tree" }, shape = "Satyr" },
    { id = "alzzin_wolf", entry = 20748, name = "Alzzin the Wildshaper", label = "Alzzin the Wildshaper", level = 58, display = 9370, height = 2.9, span = 5.8, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_WhiteDireWolf", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 22689, 19319, 3604, 8260 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Pack Hunger", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Rake", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Lope of the Dire Wolf", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Mount_WhiteDireWolf", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Throat Seeker", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Mangle", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Shaggy Pelt", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Wolf", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Rending Jaws", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_FerociousBite", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Mangle the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nIn wolf shape the Wildshaper forgets his spells and remembers only how to tear." }, { name = "Scent of the Warpwood", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Dash", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Dire Rush by 15 sec.\n\nNothing in the Warpwood outruns the dire wolf once it has the scent." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, zone = "Blade's Edge Mountains", expansion = 0, order = 305, as = 11492, box = { -0.54, -0.02, 1.39 }, title = "Corrupter of the Warpwood", visageOf = "alzzin_the_wildshaper", shape = "Dire Wolf" },
    { id = "alzzin_tree", entry = 11461, name = "Alzzin the Wildshaper", label = "Alzzin the Wildshaper", level = 58, display = 13173, height = 7.7, span = 7.7, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_TreeofLife", profile = "tank", kit = { 7948, 22691, 10101, 37548 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Corrupted Bark", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_TreeofLife", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Deep Roots", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Regeneration", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Heartwood", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ProtectionformNature", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Looming Guardian", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Thorns", text = "The threat you cause is increased by 30%." }, { name = "Lashing Branches", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Bash", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Knock Away your attacker. Once every 12 sec.\n\nThe Warpwood guardians let no one close. In their shape, neither does Alzzin." }, { name = "Wild Sap", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Rejuvenation", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Wild Regeneration by 10 sec.\n\nTree or satyr, the Wildshaper drinks the Warpwood's sap to close his wounds." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 207, as = 11492, box = { -0.09, -0.04, 3.68 }, title = "Corrupter of the Warpwood", visageOf = "alzzin_the_wildshaper", shape = "Tree" },
    { id = "stomper_kreeg", entry = 11441, name = "Stomper Kreeg", label = "Stomper Kreeg", level = 59, display = 12473, height = 6.8, span = 6.8, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Drink_05", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 15577, 16740, 22833, 8269 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Heavy Mug", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Drink_05", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Beer Gut", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Liquid Courage", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_BloodRage", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Too Drunk to Feel It", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_WarCry", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Sloshing Mug", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Beer_01", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to set off a Booze Spit. Once every 15 sec.\n\nKreeg does not so much fight as spill on people very hard." }, { name = "Another Round", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_GhoulFrenzy", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Drunken Frenzy by 15 sec.\n\nThere is always another barrel of Gordok Green Grog, and Kreeg always finds it." } }, tips = { [22833] = "Spit a spray of booze at the enemies in front of you, lowering their chance to hit by 75% for 6 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 208, as = 14322, box = { -0.07, -0.00, 3.36 }, title = "The Drunk" },
    { id = "magister_kalendris", entry = 11487, name = "Magister Kalendris", label = "Magister Kalendris", level = 60, display = 14384, height = 3.1, span = 3.1, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Shadowform", profile = "caster", kit = { 17287, 17146, 22919, 7645 }, passives = { 22917 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Shen'dralar Secrets", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Shadowform", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Highborne Poise", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordDominate", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Long Study", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_MindVision", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Veiled Magister", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Whispered Pain", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to lay Shadow Word: Pain on the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nKalendris hoards the Highborne's knowledge, and shares only the painful parts of it." }, { name = "Mind of the Magister", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyFrenzy", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Mind Blast by 2 sec.\n\nTen thousand years of study have sharpened the magister's mind to a blade." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 212, charModel = true, box = { -0.24, 0.01, 1.55 }, title = "Magister of the Shen'dralar" },
    { id = "illyanna_ravenoak", entry = 11488, name = "Illyanna Ravenoak", label = "Illyanna Ravenoak", level = 60, display = 11270, height = 2.7, span = 2.7, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Weapon_Bow_07", profile = "glass_cannon", kit = { 16100, 20735, 22914, 22908, 22910, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Warpwood Archery", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Marksmanship", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Eagle Eye", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Weapon_Bow_07", text = "Your chance to critically strike is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Huntress's Grace", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Quickshot", text = "Your Agility is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Light on Her Feet", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Slow", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Pinning Shot", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Frost_ChainsOfIce", text = "Your damaging shots have a 10% chance to fire a Concussive Shot. Once every 12 sec.\n\nIllyanna never lets her quarry run. The second arrow is always for its legs." }, { name = "Rain of the Ravenoak", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_UpgradeMoonGlaive", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Multi-Shot by 3 sec.\n\nFrom the walls of the Warpwood the huntress picks off whole packs before they reach her." } }, tips = { [261] = "Whistle for Ferra: your bear lumbers out of the Warpwood and fights for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 211, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.19, 0.12, 1.36 }, title = "Huntress of the Warpwood" },
    { id = "tendris_warpwood", entry = 11489, name = "Tendris Warpwood", label = "Tendris Warpwood", level = 60, display = 14383, height = 19.1, span = 19.1, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Root_02", profile = "tank", kit = { 5568, 22924, 22994, 22916, 261, 37548 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Ironbark", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Root_02", text = "Your armor is increased by 20%." }, { name = "Ancient Girth", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Regeneration", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Rooted in Rot", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ResistNature", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Warden of the Grove", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_StrangleVines", text = "The threat you cause is increased by 30%." }, { name = "Heavy Roots", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_WarStomp", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Trample the enemies around you. Once every 12 sec.\n\nStand at the ancient's roots and you stand where the ancient will next step." }, { name = "Grasp of the Warpwood", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_EarthBind", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Grasping Vines by 15 sec.\n\nEvery vine in the Warpwood answers the corrupted ancient's call." } }, tips = { [261] = "Ancients, rise up against these intruders! Two Ironbark Protectors tear free of the Warpwood and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 213, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 1.87, -0.04, 9.27 }, view = { 2.2293, 0.0000, 1.8590 }, title = "Corrupted Ancient of the Warpwood" },
    { id = "cho_rush_the_observer", entry = 14324, name = "Cho'Rush the Observer", label = "Cho'Rush the Observer", level = 60, display = 11537, height = 6.8, span = 6.8, school = "arcane", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Staff_13", profile = "caster", kit = { 16170, 17139 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Two Heads Think Faster", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_ArcaneTorrent", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Watchful Eyes", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Eye_01", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Ogre Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Borrowed Brains", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Staff_13", text = "Your Intellect is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Guard da King", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_PowerWordShield", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Power Word: Shield by 5 sec.\n\nCho'Rush keeps the king alive, whatever the king does to deserve otherwise." }, { name = "Rile Up da Gordok", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Bloodlust", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Bloodlust by 15 sec.\n\nAn ogre mage learns early that the fastest cure for a fight is angrier ogres." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 1005, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 210, box = { -0.07, -0.00, 3.37 }, title = "Seer of the Gordok" },
    { id = "prince_tortheldrin", entry = 11486, name = "Prince Tortheldrin", label = "Prince Tortheldrin", level = 61, display = 11256, height = 2.6, span = 2.6, school = "arcane", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_Blast", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 22920, 20691, 13736, 20537, 21655 }, passives = { 3417 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Highborne Edge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Arcane Heritage", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_Blast", text = "Your Arcane damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Glaive Dancer", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Whirlwind", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Ten Thousand Years", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_Blink", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Sanctity of Eldre'Thalas", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Arcane_Arcane04", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to set off an Arcane Blast. Once every 10 sec.\n\nFace me, cowards! The last prince of the Highborne fights with blade and spell at once." }, { name = "Dance of the Glaives", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Bladestorm", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Whirlwind by 5 sec.\n\nThe prince learned the glaive dance before the Well of Eternity fell, and has practised since." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 1005, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 216, charModel = true, box = { -0.20, 0.01, 1.30 }, title = "Ruler of the Shen'dralar" },
    { id = "immol_thar", entry = 11496, name = "Immol'thar", label = "Immol'thar", level = 61, display = 14173, height = 14.7, span = 22.4, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Eye_01", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 16128, 15550, 22899, 8269 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Fel Hunger", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Rake", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Void-Thick Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Ten Thousand Years Bound", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyStrength", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Restless Captive", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_BloodRage", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Festering Bite", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Disease_02", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to deliver an Infected Bite. Once every 15 sec.\n\nEvery Highborne who fed the prison knows the smell of that bite." }, { name = "Rattling the Chains", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_GhoulFrenzy", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Straining Frenzy by 15 sec.\n\nShut down the pylons and the demon's bonds loosen. It has waited a long time for that." } }, tips = { [22899] = "Open an Eye of Immol'thar beside you; it watches your enemies and fights for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 215, summons = { [22899] = true }, box = { -2.90, -0.02, 7.27 }, title = "Prisoner of the Shen'dralar" },
    { id = "captain_kromcrush", entry = 14325, name = "Captain Kromcrush", label = "Captain Kromcrush", level = 61, display = 11564, height = 7.2, span = 7.2, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Axe_17", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 22859, 19134, 22857, 8599, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Crush Da Punys", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Axe_17", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Big Swing", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Ogre Captain's Bulk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Gordok Muscle", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_WarCry", text = "Your Strength is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Take It", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Riposte", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Mortal Cleave the enemies before you. Once every 15 sec.\n\nNo one get past me and threaten da king! Ungh, take it!" }, { name = "Da Beatdown", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_PsychicScream", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Frightening Shout by 15 sec.\n\nKromcrush does not need to hit you to win. Most punys run when he shouts." } }, tips = { [261] = "Help me crush these punys! Two Gordok Reavers answer their captain and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Dire Maul", expansion = 0, order = 214, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.04, -0.24, 3.55 }, title = "Captain of the Gordok Guard" },
    { id = "marduk_blackpool", entry = 10433, name = "Marduk Blackpool", label = "Marduk Blackpool", level = 58, display = 10248, height = 2.7, span = 2.7, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathCoil", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 29832, 17228, 34437, 12040, 17695 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Unholy Might", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathCoil", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Runeblade Training", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_SavageBlow", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Scourge Plate", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Unliving Vigor", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyStrength", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Unholy Edge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to set off a Shadow Cleave. Once every 10 sec.\n\nMarduk showed the students that death is a craft, and he practises it with every swing." }, { name = "Betrayed", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathScream", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Death Coil by 10 sec.\n\nWe are betrayed! The death knight answers treachery faster than any student expects." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scholomance", expansion = 0, order = 219, charModel = true, box = { -0.29, -0.08, 1.36 }, title = "Death Knight of the Scourge" },
    { id = "vectus", entry = 10432, name = "Vectus", label = "Vectus", level = 60, display = 2606, height = 3.6, span = 3.6, school = "fire", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fireball", profile = "caster", kit = { 14034, 18399, 16046, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Draconic Studies", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fireball", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Pointed Questions", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SelfDestruct", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Brisk Lecture", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Book_09", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Unliving Bones", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Your Shadow resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Practical Demonstration", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FlameBolt", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to hurl a Fireball as well. Once every 15 sec.\n\nTomorrow we begin training the dragons. Today Vectus demonstrates on whoever is closest." }, { name = "Field Trip", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Volcano", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Flamestrike by 5 sec.\n\nMarduk's field trips taught the dragons what they eat. Vectus's teach the students to run." } }, tips = { [261] = "Class is in session: two Scholomance Students leave their desks and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scholomance", expansion = 0, order = 226, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.80, -0.23, 1.57 }, title = "Instructor of the Dragonflight" },
    { id = "lady_illucia_barov", entry = 10502, name = "Lady Illucia Barov", label = "Lady Illucia Barov", level = 60, display = 11835, height = 2.4, span = 2.4, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Possession", profile = "caster", kit = { 19460, 18266, 22666, 12542 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Barov Malice", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Possession", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Aristocratic Contempt", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfTounges", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Restless Spirit", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_GatherShadows", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Half in the Grave", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Family Curse", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfAchimonde", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to lay Curse of Agony on the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nHouse Barov traded Caer Darrow for the Lich King's favour. The curse came with the deed." }, { name = "Lady of the House", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_PsychicScream", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Fear by 10 sec.\n\nServants, students and adventurers alike learn to flee when the lady of House Barov looks at them." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scholomance", expansion = 0, order = 222, charModel = true, box = { -0.13, 0.01, 1.20 }, title = "Matriarch of House Barov" },
    { id = "lord_alexei_barov", entry = 10504, name = "Lord Alexei Barov", label = "Lord Alexei Barov", level = 60, display = 11072, height = 3.7, span = 3.7, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_LifeDrain02", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 16856, 20294, 17238, 17820 }, passives = { 17467 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Deed of Darkness", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_LifeDrain02", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Barov Fire", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Immolation", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Lordly Plate", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Bound to the School", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyStrength", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Inherited Flame", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Incinerate", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Immolate the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nAlexei Barov sold Caer Darrow for power, and the power still burns in his blade." }, { name = "The Barov Bargain", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_NetherCloak", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Veil of Shadow by 10 sec.\n\nThe Barovs always take more than they give. Their veil leaves nothing for the healers." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scholomance", expansion = 0, order = 223, charModel = true, box = { -0.18, -0.01, 1.86 }, title = "Lord of House Barov" },
    { id = "instructor_malicia", entry = 10505, name = "Instructor Malicia", label = "Instructor Malicia", level = 60, display = 20981, height = 2.0, span = 2.0, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", profile = "caster", kit = { 18376, 13747, 17843, 8362, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Curriculum of Rot", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Dark Grace", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_FlashHeal", text = "Your healing done is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Strict Timetable", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Slow", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Grading Curve", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AbominationExplosion", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Homework", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CreepingPlague", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to spread Corruption to the enemies around you. Once every 20 sec.\n\nMalicia never lets a lesson end early. The rot keeps working after class." }, { name = "Tardy Students", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_PocketWatch_01", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Slow by 10 sec.\n\nIn Malicia's classroom nobody moves faster than the instructor allows." } }, tips = { [261] = "Put your failed students to use: three Risen Aberrations claw their way up and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scholomance", expansion = 0, order = 221, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.07, -0.03, 1.01 }, title = "Instructor of Necromancy" },
    { id = "the_ravenian", entry = 29123, name = "The Ravenian", label = "The Ravenian", level = 60, display = 25926, height = 5.0, span = 8.0, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 25174, 15550, 18670, 20578 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Endless Appetite", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Cannibalize", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Well Fed", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Hungry Claws", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_Rake", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Bone Crusher", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Feeding Frenzy", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_WarStomp", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Trample the enemies around you. Once every 12 sec.\n\nThe Ravenian does not wait for the students to fail. It simply eats the nearest one." }, { name = "Second Helping", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Druid_FerociousBite", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Devour the Failed by 15 sec.\n\nThere is always another failed student in Scholomance, and the Ravenian is always hungry." } }, tips = { [20578] = "Devour the flesh of the fallen, regaining 8% of your health every 2 sec. for 10 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, zone = "Sholazar Basin", expansion = 0, order = 309, as = 10507, box = { 0.96, -0.39, 2.48 }, title = "Devourer of the Failed" },
    { id = "lorekeeper_polkelt", entry = 10901, name = "Lorekeeper Polkelt", label = "Lorekeeper Polkelt", level = 60, display = 11492, height = 3.5, span = 3.5, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_CorrosiveBreath", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 18149, 8245, 18151, 12001, 9591 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Plague Lore", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_CorrosiveBreath", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Bloated Corpse", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Disease_02", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Leathery Rot", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AbominationExplosion", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Immune to Plague", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_NullifyDisease", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 50." }, { name = "Dripping Rot", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Acid_01", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to spew Corrosive Acid over the enemies near you. Once every 15 sec.\n\nPolkelt keeps the plague lore in his head, and the plague itself everywhere else." }, { name = "Required Reading", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Creature_Disease_03", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Volatile Infection by 10 sec.\n\nThe lorekeeper has catalogued every plague the Scourge ever brewed. He tests them often." } }, tips = { [12001] = "Belch a plague cloud over the enemies near you, sapping their attributes for 4 min." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scholomance", expansion = 0, order = 224, box = { -0.01, -0.04, 1.72 }, title = "Keeper of the Plague Lore" },
    { id = "doctor_theolen_krastinov", entry = 11261, name = "Doctor Theolen Krastinov", label = "Doctor Theolen Krastinov", level = 60, display = 10901, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Rupture", profile = "glass_cannon", kit = { 16509, 30478, 18103, 8269 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Butchery", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_Rupture", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Steady Hands", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Riposte", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Quick Incisions", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Surgeon's Nimbleness", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Rogue_FeignDeath", text = "Your Agility is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Another Successful Operation", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Gouge", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Rend the target. Once every 10 sec.\n\nAnother successful operation! The doctor never lost a patient he meant to keep." }, { name = "Donate Your Body", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_PunishingBlow", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Backhand by 5 sec.\n\nDonate my body to science... Krastinov would rather donate yours." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 29443, soundDeath = 29444, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scholomance", expansion = 0, order = 220, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.00, 1.06 }, title = "The Butcher" },
    { id = "jandice_barov", entry = 10503, name = "Jandice Barov", label = "Jandice Barov", level = 61, display = 11073, height = 2.4, span = 2.4, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Charm", profile = "caster", kit = { 261, 16098, 8994, 18270 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Barov Blood", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Charm", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Dark Plague Lore", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_BlackPlague", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Hall of Mirrors", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ImpPhaseShift", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Quick Study", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Book_07", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Spreading Blight", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CreepingPlague", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to inflict Dark Plague on the target. Once every 15 sec.\n\nJandice learned more than illusions at Scholomance. The plague lessons stuck too." }, { name = "Which One Is Real", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_Cripple", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Banish by 10 sec.\n\nBy the time her enemies find the real Jandice, she has already put one of them out of the fight." } }, tips = { [261] = "Split into illusions: three Illusions of Jandice Barov step out of the shadows to confuse and fight your enemies for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scholomance", expansion = 0, order = 228, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.13, 0.01, 1.20 }, title = "Daughter of House Barov" },
    { id = "rattlegore", entry = 11622, name = "Rattlegore", label = "Rattlegore", level = 61, display = 12073, height = 3.9, span = 3.9, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bone_HumanSkull_01", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 18368, 10101, 16727, 11445 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Many Bones", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bone_HumanSkull_01", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Stitched Frame", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Hundred Corpses", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Rampage", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Crushing Knuckles", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_SavageBlow", text = "Your chance to critically strike with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Rattle", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_WarStomp", text = "When you are struck, you have a 10% chance to Knock Away your attacker. Once every 12 sec.\n\nHit Rattlegore and you only rattle loose a bone or two. It swings back anyway." }, { name = "Ossuary Tremor", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Earthquake", text = "Reduces the cooldown of War Stomp by 15 sec.\n\nThe bone golem's steps shake the ossuary; its stomp shakes the whole of Scholomance." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scholomance", expansion = 0, order = 229, box = { 0.38, 0.26, 1.69 }, view = { 1.0249, 0.4326, 1.4184 }, title = "Bone Golem of the Ossuary" },
    { id = "crowd_pummeler_9_60", entry = 6229, name = "Crowd Pummeler 9-60", label = "Crowd Pummeler 9-60", level = 28, display = 6774, height = 3.7, span = 3.7, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Gizmo_02", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 10887, 16169, 5568, 18812, 28371 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Riveted Plating", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ArmorKit_14", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Reinforced Chassis", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Gizmo_04", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Hydraulic Pistons", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Gizmo_01", text = "Your attack power is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Crowd Control Programming", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your Physical damage is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Riot Protocol", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Whirlwind", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to swing an Arcing Smash. Once every 10 sec.\n\nModel 9-60 does not wait for a crowd to disperse. It sweeps." }, { name = "Model 9-60 Upgrade", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Gizmo_02", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Crowd Pummel by 4 sec.\n\nSixty crowds pummelled per hour, promised the brochure. Mekgineer Thermaplugg ordered it faster." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Gnomeregan", expansion = 0, order = 94, box = { -0.39, -0.04, 1.65 }, title = "Riot Suppression Unit" },
    { id = "electrocutioner_6000", entry = 6235, name = "Electrocutioner 6000", label = "Electrocutioner 6000", level = 28, display = 6915, height = 3.2, span = 3.5, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_LightningOverload", profile = "caster", kit = { 11084, 11085, 11082, 11820 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Electric Justice", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_LightningOverload", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Overclocked Coils", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Lightning", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Spider-Tank Hull", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_ArmorKit_14", text = "Your armor is increased by 15%." }, { name = "Grounded Frame", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ResistNature", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 30." }, { name = "Arc Discharge", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_LightningShield", text = "When you are struck, you have a 15% chance to Shock your attacker. Once every 8 sec.\n\nTouch the Electrocutioner and the Electrocutioner touches back." }, { name = "High Voltage", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ChainLightning", text = "Your Megavolt reaches 20% farther.\n\nThe pilot bypassed the safety relays years ago. The grid answers every call at full power." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 5811, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Gnomeregan", expansion = 0, order = 95, box = { -0.35, -0.00, 1.60 }, view = { -2.0064, 0.3584, 1.0390 }, voices = { { 5811, 1.5, true, "Electric justice!" } }, title = "Gnomeregan Security Automaton" },
    { id = "viscous_fallout", entry = 7079, name = "Viscous Fallout", label = "Viscous Fallout", level = 28, display = 5497, height = 4.5, span = 5.7, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Acid_01", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 21687, 9771, 9459, 10341, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Fallout", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Acid_01", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Viscous Mass", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_AbolishMagic", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Irradiated Goo", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ResistNature", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 40." }, { name = "Amorphous", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_UnholyFrenzy", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Critical Mass", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_CorrosiveBreath", text = "Your damaging spells have a 10% chance to hurl a Radiation Bolt. Once every 10 sec.\n\nEvery splash of the fallout carries a little more of the reactor with it." }, { name = "Meltdown", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_NatureTouchDecay", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Toxic Volley by 3 sec.\n\nThe more it absorbs, the less it holds. The fallout sprays whatever it cannot keep." } }, tips = { [261] = "Shed two Irradiated Slimes from your mass; they fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Gnomeregan", expansion = 0, order = 97, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { 0.01, 0.00, 2.88 }, title = "Living Radiation" },
    { id = "interrogator_vishas", entry = 3983, name = "Interrogator Vishas", label = "Interrogator Vishas", level = 32, display = 2044, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", profile = "glass_cannon", kit = { 15581, 14032, 16568, 7399, 12555 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Purged by Pain", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowWordPain", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Twin Pokers", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_DualWield", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Practiced Cruelty", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_BackStab", text = "Your chance to critically hit with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Graveyard Watch", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Stealth", text = "Your chance to dodge is increased by 4%." }, { name = "Naughty Secrets", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_CurseOfSargeras", text = "Your melee hits have a 6% chance to lay Shadow Word: Pain on the target. Once every 12 sec.\n\nEvery jab of the poker asks the same question. Vishas already knows he will like the answer." }, { name = "Tell Me Everything", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_SiphonMana", text = "Your Interrogate deals 15% more damage.\n\nVorrel Sengutz told him everything, in the end. It did not save him." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 5847, soundDeath = 5848, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scarlet Monastery", expansion = 0, order = 100, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.00, 1.06 }, voices = { { 5847, 2.8, true, "Tell me... tell me everything!" }, { 5849, 1.4, true, "Naughty secrets!" }, { 5850, 2.3, true, "I'll rip the secrets from your flesh!" }, { 5848, 1.5, true, "Purged by pain!" } }, title = "Scarlet Interrogator" },
    { id = "houndmaster_loksey", entry = 3974, name = "Houndmaster Loksey", label = "Houndmaster Loksey", level = 34, display = 2040, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_BeastCall", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 261, 6742, 9128, 26211, 15589 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Pack Leader", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_BeastCall", text = "Your attack power is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Twin Hatchets", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_DualWield", text = "Your attack speed is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Kennel Brawler", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Parry", text = "Your chance to parry is increased by 4%." }, { name = "Hunt the Heretic", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_SniperShot", text = "Your movement speed is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Run It Down", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_ShockWave", text = "Your melee hits have an 8% chance to Hamstring the target. Once every 12 sec.\n\nLoksey never needs to catch his quarry. He only needs to slow it until the hounds do." }, { name = "Well-Fed Pack", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Hunter_Pet_Wolf", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Release the Hounds by 20 sec.\n\nThe kennels of the Monastery are never empty for long. Loksey breeds for speed." } }, tips = { [261] = "Release the hounds! Two Scarlet Tracking Hounds bound from the kennels and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 5841, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scarlet Monastery", expansion = 0, order = 101, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.10, -0.00, 1.06 }, voices = { { 5841, 1.4, true, "Release the hounds!" } }, title = "Master of the Scarlet Kennels" },
    { id = "high_inquisitor_fairbanks", entry = 4542, name = "High Inquisitor Fairbanks", label = "High Inquisitor Fairbanks", level = 40, display = 2605, height = 2.1, span = 2.1, school = "holy", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_SealOfWrath", profile = "caster", kit = { 9481, 17194, 8282, 11647, 12039, 15090 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Faded Zeal", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_HolySmite", text = "Your Holy damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Rotting Secret", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Inquisitor's Mercy", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Heal", text = "Your healing is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Unquiet Flesh", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Your Shadow resistance is increased by 30." }, { name = "Betrayed by Mograine", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_PowerWordShield", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Power Word: Shield by 10 sec.\n\nHe never saw the blow coming from his own Commander. He shields himself first now." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 154, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Scarlet Monastery", expansion = 0, order = 104, charModel = true, box = { -0.22, -0.06, 1.05 }, view = { -0.0998, 0.0134, -0.1254 }, title = "The First High Inquisitor" },
    { id = "mordresh_fire_eye", entry = 7357, name = "Mordresh Fire Eye", label = "Mordresh Fire Eye", level = 37, display = 8055, height = 3.6, span = 3.6, school = "fire", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SelfDestruct", profile = "caster", kit = { 12466, 12470, 9574, 134, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Fire Eye", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_SelfDestruct", text = "Your Fire damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Burning Gaze", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FlameBolt", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Bones of the Razorfen", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", text = "Your armor is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Deathless", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AntiShadow", text = "Your Shadow resistance is increased by 30." }, { name = "We Will Spread", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_Fire", text = "Your damaging spells have an 8% chance to set off a Fire Nova around you. Once every 15 sec.\n\nWe will spread across this barren land! The fire in the dead seer's eye leaps from every spell." }, { name = "Soon the Scourge Will Rule", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Fire_FlameShock", text = "Your Fire Nova reaches 30% farther.\n\nAmnennar promised him the Barrens. Mordresh means to burn every acre of it himself." } }, tips = { [261] = "Slay them, my brethren! Two Death's Head Cultists answer and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 286, soundTransform = 5822, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Razorfen Downs", expansion = 0, order = 112, summons = { [261] = true }, box = { -0.10, -0.18, 1.80 }, voices = { { 5819, 3.0, false, "We will enslave the quilboar!" }, { 5820, 3.4, false, "We will spread across this barren land!" }, { 5821, 3.8, false, "Soon, the Scourge will rule the world!" }, { 5822, 3.6, true, "Slay them, my brethren! For the Scourge!" } }, title = "Scourge of the Razorfen" },
    { id = "glutton", entry = 8567, name = "Glutton", label = "Glutton", level = 37, display = 7864, height = 5.1, span = 5.4, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AbominationExplosion", profile = "tank", kit = { 37486, 38895, 50538, 5164, 12795 }, passives = { 12627 }, talentInfo = { { name = "Stitched Bulk", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AbominationExplosion", text = "Your maximum health is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Rotting Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_MonsterScales_15", text = "Your armor is increased by 12%." }, { name = "Plague Gut", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ResistNature", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 40." }, { name = "Dull to Pain", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_DefensiveStance", text = "Damage you take is reduced by 5%." }, { name = "Getting Hungry", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Food_14", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Frenzy by 15 sec.\n\nGlutton is getting hungry. Glutton is always getting hungry." } }, tips = {}, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 5823, soundDeath = 5824, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Razorfen Downs", expansion = 0, order = 111, box = { -0.36, 0.03, 2.35 }, voices = { { 5823, 3.3, true, "Me smell stench of the living!" }, { 5824, 2.8, true, "Me feast on you all!" } }, title = "Hunger of the Razorfen" },
    { id = "chief_ukorz_sandscalp", entry = 7267, name = "Chief Ukorz Sandscalp", label = "Chief Ukorz Sandscalp", level = 46, display = 6439, height = 3.2, span = 3.2, school = "physical", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Avatar", profile = "bruiser", kit = { 15496, 11837, 20716, 22120, 8269, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Sandfury Supremacy", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_BattleShout", text = "Your attack power is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Berserker's Way", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Racial_Avatar", text = "Your chance to critically hit with melee attacks is increased by 5%." }, { name = "Desert Hardened", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ResistNature", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 30." }, { name = "Chief's Plate", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Chest_Plate06", text = "Your armor is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Die, Outlander", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Ability_Warrior_Cleave", text = "Your melee hits have a 10% chance to Cleave. Once every 8 sec.\n\nDie, outlander! The chief does not stop at one head." }, { name = "Storm on Call", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_Cyclone", text = "Reduces the cooldown of your Fury of the Sands by 5 sec.\n\nThe desert answers the Sandfury chief. The storm comes sooner each time he calls it." } }, tips = { [261] = "Call your bodyguard: Ruuzlu steps in beside you and fights for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 437, soundTransform = 5876, soundDeath = 5877, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Zul'Farrak", expansion = 0, order = 137, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.03, 0.04, 1.58 }, voices = { { 5877, 1.2, true, "Die, outlander!" }, { 5879, 3.2, true, "Feel the fury of the sands!" }, { 5878, 2.4, true, "The Sandfury reign supreme!" }, { 5876, 1.7, true, "This desert be mine!" } }, title = "Chief of the Sandfury" },
    { id = "witch_doctor_zumrah", entry = 7271, name = "Witch Doctor Zum'rah", label = "Witch Doctor Zum'rah", level = 46, display = 6434, height = 2.6, span = 2.6, school = "shadow", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_RaiseDead", profile = "caster", kit = { 12739, 15245, 12741, 12491, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Voodoo of the Sands", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_ShadowBolt", text = "Your Shadow damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Loa's Favour", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_HealingWaveGreater", text = "Your healing is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Grave Focus", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_DeathCoil", text = "Your casting speed is increased by 6%." }, { name = "Sandfury Hide", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ResistNature", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 30." }, { name = "The Graveyard Stirs", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Shadow_AnimateDead", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Ward of Zum'rah by 20 sec.\n\nZul'Farrak buried its heroes by the hundred. Zum'rah never runs short of dead." } }, tips = { [261] = "Raise the graveyard's dead: two Skeletons of Zum'rah claw out of the sand and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 7775, soundTransform = 5872, soundDeath = 5873, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Zul'Farrak", expansion = 0, order = 141, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.03, 0.03, 1.32 }, voices = { { 5873, 1.4, true, "Fall!" }, { 5872, 2.9, true, "Sands consume you!" } }, title = "Keeper of the Graveyard" },
    { id = "theka_the_martyr", entry = 7272, name = "Theka the Martyr", label = "Theka the Martyr", level = 46, display = 6696, height = 2.6, span = 2.6, school = "nature", pool = "classic_dungeon", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_NullifyDisease", profile = "caster", kit = { 8600, 3256, 17238, 8362, 261 }, passives = {}, talentInfo = { { name = "Fevered Faith", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_NullifyDisease", text = "Your Nature damage is increased by 10%." }, { name = "Martyr's Patience", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Holy_Renew", text = "Your healing is increased by 8%." }, { name = "Sand-Scoured Flesh", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_ResistNature", text = "Your Nature resistance is increased by 30." }, { name = "Scarab Priest", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_AhnQirajTrinket_02", text = "Your chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 4%." }, { name = "Give Them Your Flesh", icon = "Interface\\Icons\\Spell_Nature_InsectSwarm", text = "Reduces the cooldown of Scarab Swarm by 20 sec.\n\nThe scarabs of Zul'Farrak were fed on Theka long before they learned to come when he calls." } }, tips = { [261] = "Call the temple's scarabs: three Scarabs boil out of the sand and fight for you for 20 sec." }, visualKit = 282, soundTransform = 0, soundDeath = 0, flies = false, wave = 4, instance = "Zul'Farrak", expansion = 0, order = 140, summons = { [261] = true }, charModel = true, box = { -0.03, 0.03, 1.32 }, title = "Priest of the Scarab", visages = { "theka_scarab" }, shape = "Dragon" },
